('126034b6-ce3d-4d45-b4b6-5221e01e4d21', 'Full-Day Catamaran Trip to Gabriel Island (From Backup: May 18)', '<p>Île&nbsp;aux&nbsp;Gabriel&nbsp;catamaran&nbsp;trips&nbsp;are&nbsp;among&nbsp;the&nbsp;most&nbsp;scenic&nbsp;experiences&nbsp;in&nbsp;northern&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;combining&nbsp;island&nbsp;hopping,&nbsp;snorkeling,&nbsp;and&nbsp;relaxing&nbsp;sailing&nbsp;across&nbsp;clear&nbsp;lagoon&nbsp;waters.</p><p>The&nbsp;route&nbsp;often&nbsp;includes&nbsp;stops&nbsp;at&nbsp;Île&nbsp;Plate,&nbsp;known&nbsp;for&nbsp;its&nbsp;long&nbsp;sandy&nbsp;beaches&nbsp;and&nbsp;shallow&nbsp;turquoise&nbsp;waters&nbsp;ideal&nbsp;for&nbsp;swimming.&nbsp;Boats&nbsp;also&nbsp;pass&nbsp;near&nbsp;Coin&nbsp;de&nbsp;Mire,&nbsp;a&nbsp;dramatic&nbsp;rocky&nbsp;islet&nbsp;popular&nbsp;for&nbsp;birdlife&nbsp;and&nbsp;photography.</p><p>Onboard,&nbsp;visitors&nbsp;typically&nbsp;enjoy&nbsp;barbecue&nbsp;lunches,&nbsp;music,&nbsp;and&nbsp;sunbathing&nbsp;on&nbsp;deck&nbsp;while&nbsp;cruising&nbsp;between&nbsp;islands.&nbsp;The&nbsp;calm&nbsp;northern&nbsp;sea&nbsp;conditions&nbsp;make&nbsp;it&nbsp;suitable&nbsp;for&nbsp;families,&nbsp;while&nbsp;the&nbsp;coral&nbsp;reefs&nbsp;offer&nbsp;frequent&nbsp;sightings&nbsp;of&nbsp;colorful&nbsp;fish&nbsp;and&nbsp;marine&nbsp;biodiversity&nbsp;during&nbsp;snorkeling&nbsp;stops.</p> (Imported from backup variant: JSON: TL_FULL_BACKUP_2026-05-18T08-17-19-209Z.json)', 'Balaclava', 'North Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778911832092-jtute24pzyi.jpg', '["BBQ LUNCH","SOFT DRINKS & ALCOHOL","MUSIC & ENTERTAINMENT","SNORKELING"]'::jsonb, 'activity', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:17:53.002654+00:00', '2026-05-20T04:17:53.002654+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778911952045-9883kjpvx1.jpg","services/1778911967429-o3f9sl0zhog.jpg","services/1778911974189-p6mhb1ujszh.webp","services/1778911989555-a890j6kx1wt.jpg","services/1778912015282-spqhs21awz.jpg","services/1778912040356-fez491ihew.jpg","services/1778912095929-4cgf0nvhzku.jpg","services/1778912406790-6gozqx5n3dr.jpg","services/1778912730015-4ha4f2ntqlq.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'services/1778911847664-ai2ljit9aec.jpg', false, 0, 'services/1778911865034-shuyc2o6uk.jpg', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'Île aux Gabriel catamaran trips offer scenic northern Mauritius cruises, snorkeling, and turquoise lagoon views.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[]'::jsonb, 'Sea', 0, NULL),
('126067c2-b1c9-4c4e-8fef-be10f5153942', 'Ocean''s Creek Beach Hotel (From Backup: May 20)', '<p><span style="background-color: rgb(254, 254, 254); color: rgb(103, 105, 118);">Managed&nbsp;by&nbsp;Shanti&nbsp;Hospitality,&nbsp;Ocean&#39;s&nbsp;Creek&nbsp;Beach&nbsp;Hotel&nbsp;has&nbsp;nested&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;coastal&nbsp;northwest&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;near&nbsp;Balaclava.&nbsp;With&nbsp;its&nbsp;strategic&nbsp;location,&nbsp;the&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;is&nbsp;accessible&nbsp;to&nbsp;every&nbsp;part&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;discovering&nbsp;the&nbsp;culture&nbsp;and&nbsp;nature&nbsp;experience&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;island.&nbsp;The&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;offers&nbsp;splendid&nbsp;view&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;Tombeau&nbsp;River&nbsp;and&nbsp;Le&nbsp;Goulet&nbsp;Beach,&nbsp;offering&nbsp;a&nbsp;warm&nbsp;sunset&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;end&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;day.&nbsp;With&nbsp;365&nbsp;days&nbsp;of&nbsp;versatile&nbsp;fun,&nbsp;Ocean&#39;s&nbsp;Creek&nbsp;ensures&nbsp;a&nbsp;vibrant&nbsp;guest&nbsp;experience&nbsp;with&nbsp;its&nbsp;team.</span></p><p></p><p>Check-in&nbsp;at&nbsp;14:00</p><p>Check-out&nbsp;11:00.</p> (Imported from backup variant: SQL: seed_2026-05-16.sql)', 'Balaclava', 'Mauritius', 4.5, 'services/1777544979317-7689fp46j2w.jpg', '["Wifi ","In-house Cinema"," Laundry service","spa","gym","Up to 50 parking places and coach parking","Water Leisure - Pool & Jacuzzi","Kids Club","Indoor & Outdoor Activities"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:15:42.600462+00:00', '2026-05-20T04:15:42.600462+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1777545040285-k6q0a87zs9c.jpg","services/1777545051493-7kxrofg188e.jpg","services/1777545092213-u7v171yantc.jpg","services/1777545099676-dt17a99janu.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '<p>(No&nbsp;show,&nbsp;shortening&nbsp;of&nbsp;stay,&nbsp;unexpected&nbsp;departure,&nbsp;etc.):</p><p><strong>100%&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;total&nbsp;booking&nbsp;value/charges</strong>&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;applicable,&nbsp;as&nbsp;from&nbsp;confirmation&nbsp;date.</p>', '<ul><li><ul><li>The&nbsp;above&nbsp;rates&nbsp;are&nbsp;quoted&nbsp;in&nbsp;<strong>MUR</strong>,&nbsp;on&nbsp;<strong>All-Inclusive&nbsp;basis</strong>,&nbsp;and&nbsp;inclusive&nbsp;of&nbsp;all&nbsp;charges.</li><li>Applicable&nbsp;only&nbsp;to&nbsp;<u>new&nbsp;bookings</u>.&nbsp;</li><li>Note&nbsp;that&nbsp;the&nbsp;rooms&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;subject&nbsp;to&nbsp;availability&nbsp;upon&nbsp;booking&nbsp;time.</li><li>Check-in&nbsp;at&nbsp;14:00&nbsp;and&nbsp;Check-out&nbsp;11:00.</li><li>Other&nbsp;T&amp;Cs&nbsp;apply.</li></ul></li></ul>', NULL, 'services/1777545007002-cqaqx5iavxl.jpg', false, 0, 'services/1777545016824-dn4hf3bn41.jpg', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'Managed by Shanti Hospitality, Ocean''s Creek Beach Hotel has nested on the coastal northwest of Mauritius, near Balaclava.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[{"id":"1778141488777","label":"All inclusive"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 0, NULL),
('13bb5e74-fd3c-4d73-860f-eaddc12add2f', 'Vallé Advenature Park Entrance Ticket (From Backup: May 19)', '<p>Vallé&nbsp;Advenature&nbsp;Park&nbsp;is&nbsp;an&nbsp;adventure&nbsp;and&nbsp;nature&nbsp;attraction&nbsp;in&nbsp;Mauritius&nbsp;offering&nbsp;a&nbsp;mix&nbsp;of&nbsp;outdoor&nbsp;activities&nbsp;and&nbsp;scenic&nbsp;experiences&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;lush&nbsp;natural&nbsp;setting.&nbsp;Visitors&nbsp;can&nbsp;enjoy&nbsp;activities&nbsp;like&nbsp;ziplining,&nbsp;quad&nbsp;biking,&nbsp;hiking,&nbsp;and&nbsp;exploring&nbsp;green&nbsp;landscapes&nbsp;that&nbsp;showcase&nbsp;the&nbsp;island’s&nbsp;tropical&nbsp;beauty.&nbsp;The&nbsp;park&nbsp;is&nbsp;designed&nbsp;for&nbsp;both&nbsp;thrill-seekers&nbsp;and&nbsp;nature&nbsp;lovers,&nbsp;providing&nbsp;guided&nbsp;experiences,&nbsp;viewpoints,&nbsp;and&nbsp;opportunities&nbsp;to&nbsp;discover&nbsp;local&nbsp;flora&nbsp;and&nbsp;fauna.&nbsp;It&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;popular&nbsp;spot&nbsp;for&nbsp;families,&nbsp;tourists,&nbsp;and&nbsp;groups&nbsp;looking&nbsp;for&nbsp;an&nbsp;active&nbsp;day&nbsp;outdoors&nbsp;surrounded&nbsp;by&nbsp;Mauritius’&nbsp;rich&nbsp;natural&nbsp;environment.</p><p></p><p><strong style="color: lab(7.78673 1.82345 -15.0537); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Opening&nbsp;hours&nbsp;:&nbsp;Monday&nbsp;to&nbsp;Sunday&nbsp;-&nbsp;</strong><strong>9:00&nbsp;AM&nbsp;to&nbsp;5:30&nbsp;PM</strong></p> (Imported from backup variant: SQL: seed_2026-05-19.sql)', 'Chamouny', 'South Coast', 4.5, 'services/1779082528497-yfuzffr0we8.jpg', '["Wifi","Toilet","Kids’ adventure park and play area","Scenic viewpoints","Waterfalls and nature spots","Parking facilities","Activities","restaurant"]'::jsonb, 'activity', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:18:17.367397+00:00', '2026-05-20T04:18:17.367397+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1779082654623-717zrma8hls.jpg","services/1779082668492-fxrborsi5to.jpg","services/1779083621727-igscg2hsvll.jpg","services/1779083657679-7b4a57wl1m