('2002793e-b6bf-4d06-aae5-7872f9d71184', 'Domaine de Labourdonnais - Price Variant', '<p>Domaine&nbsp;de&nbsp;Labourdonnais&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;historic&nbsp;Mauritian&nbsp;estate&nbsp;known&nbsp;for&nbsp;its&nbsp;colonial&nbsp;château,&nbsp;tropical&nbsp;gardens,&nbsp;refined&nbsp;gastronomy,&nbsp;and&nbsp;authentic&nbsp;cultural&nbsp;experiences.</p><p>Located&nbsp;in&nbsp;Mapou,&nbsp;Domaine&nbsp;de&nbsp;Labourdonnais&nbsp;offers&nbsp;visitors&nbsp;a&nbsp;glimpse&nbsp;into&nbsp;Mauritius’&nbsp;rich&nbsp;heritage&nbsp;and&nbsp;elegant&nbsp;lifestyle.&nbsp;Guests&nbsp;can&nbsp;explore&nbsp;the&nbsp;19th-century&nbsp;château,&nbsp;stroll&nbsp;through&nbsp;lush&nbsp;orchards&nbsp;and&nbsp;gardens,&nbsp;taste&nbsp;local&nbsp;products&nbsp;such&nbsp;as&nbsp;artisanal&nbsp;rum&nbsp;and&nbsp;jams,&nbsp;and&nbsp;enjoy&nbsp;a&nbsp;peaceful&nbsp;atmosphere&nbsp;surrounded&nbsp;by&nbsp;nature.</p><p></p><p><strong>Opening&nbsp;hours:&nbsp;Monday&nbsp;to&nbsp;Sunday&nbsp;-&nbsp;9:00&nbsp;AM&nbsp;to&nbsp;5:00&nbsp;PM&nbsp;(last&nbsp;admission&nbsp;at&nbsp;3:45&nbsp;PM)</strong></p> (Variant with different pricing)', 'Mapou', 'North Coast', 4.5, 'services/1779087623921-kqt9hn3q99i.jpg', '["Wifi","Toilet","PARKING FACILITIES","SHOPS","Restaurants & cafés","Gardens & orchards","Little farm","Rum & fruit product tasting bar","Express mini train ride","Underground Museum","ACTIVITIES"]'::jsonb, 'activity', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-19T14:29:30.509+00:00', '2026-05-19T14:29:30.509+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1779087604948-df8glyewuet.jpg","services/1779087660157-b8bu7rx6bl7.jpg","services/1779087674035-38uhizklgz3.jpg","services/1779087683452-q6qbeuzi7t.jpg","services/1779087694816-qg07ydjfciq.jpg","services/1779087703156-3wekpggbw33.jpg","services/1779087720229-tuh2oy7kqq.jpg","services/1779087757798-nvqvahygger.jpg","services/1779087778974-iy0yu0qztz.jpg","services/1779087786523-eopnxquab6n.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NU