('2a1e10e1-bbf2-4be3-bb48-c015b1974c68', 'Tropical Attitude (Different Pricing)', '<p><span style="background-color: rgb(248, 253, 254); color: rgb(16, 76, 82);">At&nbsp;Tropical&nbsp;Attitude,&nbsp;time&nbsp;becomes&nbsp;wonderfully&nbsp;irrelevant&nbsp;–&nbsp;and&nbsp;that’s&nbsp;exactly&nbsp;its&nbsp;charm.&nbsp;Every&nbsp;room&nbsp;at&nbsp;this&nbsp;intimate&nbsp;boutique&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;opens&nbsp;up&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;sea.&nbsp;Your&nbsp;days&nbsp;here&nbsp;follow&nbsp;the&nbsp;tide,&nbsp;the&nbsp;moving&nbsp;shade&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;coconut&nbsp;palms,&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;daily&nbsp;routines&nbsp;of&nbsp;local&nbsp;fishermen.</span></p><p></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(248, 253, 254); color: rgb(16, 76, 82);">So&nbsp;hit&nbsp;‘pause’.&nbsp;Breathe&nbsp;out.&nbsp;And&nbsp;slip&nbsp;into&nbsp;the&nbsp;laid-back&nbsp;rhythm&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;East&nbsp;Coast.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(248, 253, 254); color: rgb(16, 76, 82);">After&nbsp;all,&nbsp;isn’t&nbsp;that&nbsp;what&nbsp;holidays&nbsp;are&nbsp;for?</span></p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;12&nbsp;HRS</p> (With different pricing variants)', NULL, NULL, 4.5, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-19T16:22:57.823+00:00', '2026-05-19T16:22:57.823+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, 0, NULL, false, 'Limited Time', true, false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 12, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 0, NULL),
('2b43e23c-e663-44d6-a48b-e30e6c9c95a1', '5 Islands Tour by Speedboat (From Backup: May 19)', '<p>A&nbsp;5-island&nbsp;speedboat&nbsp;tour&nbsp;in&nbsp;Mauritius&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;popular&nbsp;day&nbsp;trip&nbsp;where&nbsp;you&nbsp;cruise&nbsp;across&nbsp;clear&nbsp;lagoons&nbsp;and&nbsp;visit&nbsp;several&nbsp;scenic&nbsp;islands.&nbsp;Along&nbsp;the&nbsp;way,&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;enjoy&nbsp;snorkeling&nbsp;in&nbsp;coral&nbsp;reefs,&nbsp;spotting&nbsp;marine&nbsp;life,&nbsp;and&nbsp;relaxing&nbsp;on&nbsp;white&nbsp;sandy&nbsp;beaches.&nbsp;Some&nbsp;stops&nbsp;often&nbsp;include&nbsp;Île&nbsp;aux&nbsp;Cerfs&nbsp;and&nbsp;nearby&nbsp;islets,&nbsp;with&nbsp;time&nbsp;for&nbsp;swimming,&nbsp;photos,&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;fresh&nbsp;seafood&nbsp;lunch&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;coast.</p> (Imported from backup variant: SQL: seed_2026-05-19.sql)', 'Trou d''eau Douces', 'East Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778915311556-1ygukci5yhb.jpg', '["BBQ LUNCH","DRINKS","SWIMMING AT ILE AUX AIGRETTES","SNORKELING","Experienced skipper ","Free time on beaches for swimming and relaxing","Music onboard"]'::jsonb, 'activity', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:17:52.512458+00:00', '2026-05-20T04:17:52.512458+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778914828093-p22ogiab99c.jpg","services/1778914853993-65c85oyrlmv.webp","services/1778914873789-3auuuutpcwb.jpg","services/1778914898977-vasgg4eggf.jpg","services/1778914924092-k7vob1jdoid.webp","services/1778914941932-2w6mnjwzy8b.jpg","services/1778915147581-1dawdcxtx5m.jpg","services/1778915243593-abeflmr713e.png","services/1778915283649-7qv35r3oqqb.jpg","services/1778915294406-71n2yp2r7mx.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'services/1778914773217-edei8gmbxq.jpg', false, 0, 'services/1778914798220-fg144n9ehyv.jpg', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'A 5-island speedboat tour in Mauritius offers a full-day adventure across turquoise lagoons, combi