('2ee417b3-018e-4a62-8d6e-2c67cfc0d1d5', 'Malaysia Package (From Backup: May 8)', '<ul><li>6&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;at&nbsp;Hotel&nbsp;Royal&nbsp;(or&nbsp;Similar)</li><li>Daily&nbsp;Breakfast&nbsp;Included</li><li>Airport&nbsp;Transfers&nbsp;Included</li><li>Half-Day&nbsp;City&nbsp;Tour&nbsp;</li><li>Half-Day&nbsp;Country&nbsp;Tour&nbsp;to&nbsp;Batu&nbsp;Caves</li><li>Full-Day&nbsp;Genting&nbsp;Highlands&nbsp;Tour&nbsp;(Inclusive&nbsp;of&nbsp;Cable&nbsp;Car&nbsp;Tickets)</li><li>All&nbsp;Tours&nbsp;on&nbsp;Sharing&nbsp;Basis</li></ul><p></p><p>Discover&nbsp;the&nbsp;vibrant&nbsp;beauty&nbsp;of&nbsp;Malaysia&nbsp;with&nbsp;an&nbsp;unforgettable&nbsp;journey&nbsp;through&nbsp;modern&nbsp;cities,&nbsp;rich&nbsp;culture,&nbsp;and&nbsp;tropical&nbsp;escapes.&nbsp;Explore&nbsp;the&nbsp;iconic&nbsp;skyline&nbsp;of&nbsp;Kuala&nbsp;Lumpur,&nbsp;experience&nbsp;the&nbsp;heritage&nbsp;charm&nbsp;of&nbsp;George&nbsp;Town,&nbsp;and&nbsp;relax&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;stunning&nbsp;beaches&nbsp;of&nbsp;Langkawi.&nbsp;With&nbsp;comfortable&nbsp;accommodation,&nbsp;daily&nbsp;breakfast,&nbsp;guided&nbsp;tours,&nbsp;and&nbsp;airport&nbsp;transfers&nbsp;included,&nbsp;this&nbsp;package&nbsp;offers&nbsp;the&nbsp;perfect&nbsp;blend&nbsp;of&nbsp;adventure,&nbsp;culture,&nbsp;and&nbsp;relaxation.</p> (Imported from backup variant: JSON: TL_SEED_BACKUP_2026-05-08.json)', NULL, 'MALAYSIA', 4.5, 'services/1778068010670-ar90dlj6nsu.jpg', '[]'::jsonb, 'packages', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:17:20.844881+00:00', '2026-05-20T04:17:20.844881+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778068568718-ux7mphiggg.jpg","services/1778068639688-qo7kzbh1lub.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '["Cost of package per person sharing double room"]'::jsonb, '["1. Accommodation (hotels, resorts, or apartments)","2. Airport transfers (in many mid/high-tier packages)","3. Guided tours or sightseeing (depending on the itinerary)","4. Transport between destinations (bus, tra