('37225699-5e20-4efa-a445-9729880033a6', 'Île des Deux Cocos (Saturday Offer) (From Backup: May 19)', '<p>Île&nbsp;des&nbsp;Deux&nbsp;Cocos&nbsp;is&nbsp;an&nbsp;exclusive&nbsp;private&nbsp;island&nbsp;retreat&nbsp;situated&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;turquoise&nbsp;lagoon&nbsp;of&nbsp;Blue&nbsp;Bay,&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;surrounded&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;protected&nbsp;waters&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;Blue&nbsp;Bay&nbsp;Marine&nbsp;Park.&nbsp;Known&nbsp;for&nbsp;its&nbsp;serene&nbsp;atmosphere&nbsp;and&nbsp;natural&nbsp;beauty,&nbsp;the&nbsp;island&nbsp;offers&nbsp;visitors&nbsp;an&nbsp;unforgettable&nbsp;all-inclusive&nbsp;experience&nbsp;featuring&nbsp;snorkeling&nbsp;among&nbsp;colorful&nbsp;coral&nbsp;reefs,&nbsp;relaxing&nbsp;on&nbsp;pristine&nbsp;white-sand&nbsp;beaches,&nbsp;enjoying&nbsp;gourmet&nbsp;buffet&nbsp;meals&nbsp;and&nbsp;unlimited&nbsp;drinks,&nbsp;and&nbsp;participating&nbsp;in&nbsp;fun&nbsp;beach&nbsp;and&nbsp;water&nbsp;activities.&nbsp;The&nbsp;island&nbsp;also&nbsp;features&nbsp;a&nbsp;beautiful&nbsp;Moorish-style&nbsp;villa,&nbsp;tropical&nbsp;gardens,&nbsp;and&nbsp;crystal-clear&nbsp;lagoons,&nbsp;making&nbsp;it&nbsp;a&nbsp;popular&nbsp;destination&nbsp;for&nbsp;romantic&nbsp;getaways,&nbsp;family&nbsp;outings,&nbsp;weddings,&nbsp;and&nbsp;luxury&nbsp;day&nbsp;excursions&nbsp;in&nbsp;Mauritius.</p> (Imported from backup variant: SQL: seed_2026-05-19.sql)', 'Blue Bay', 'South Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778739897167-ozpzycyv5a.webp', '["wifi","Beachfront","Activities","Lunch Buffet","Drinks"]'::jsonb, 'activity', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:18:16.148236+00:00', '2026-05-20T04:18:16.148236+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778741623732-gpjpqejqewe.jpg","services/1778741636582-kdc1b6g8ue.jpg","services/1778741644465-gnng219m93s.jpg","services/1778741654993-rrrwmhxgwd.jpg","services/1778741667550-wji14teozwq.jpg","services/1778741678815-yxcoiygbude.jpg","services/1778741707619-qo25h2v4fe.jpg","services/1778741724631-opm4yykzv.jpg","services/1778741781612-9qm26ozkona.webp","services/1778741953133-nl1rztd1k5e.webp"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["10H00 - 15H30","Boat Transfers","A refreshing welcome cocktail","A sumptuous Lunch Buffet as from 12h30 -14h00","Unlimited Non-Alcoholic locally Bottled drinks (Still & Sparkling water, Soft Drinks, Fruit Juices) ","2 beers or 2 glass of wine during lunch time"," Swim in crystal clear warm waters, snorkel amongst the corals andshoals of bright tropical fish  flitting around the offshore of the Blue Bay marine park or visit it the by glass- bottom boat","Visit of the Moorish-style villa dating back to the 1920 (depending upon availability)"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '<p>Days&nbsp;prior&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;event&nbsp;</p><p>30&nbsp;-&nbsp;21&nbsp;days&nbsp;–&nbsp;25%&nbsp;</p><p>20&nbsp;-&nbsp;8&nbsp;days&nbsp;–&nbsp;50%&nbsp;</p><p>7&nbsp;-&nbsp;3&nbsp;days&nbsp;–&nbsp;75%&nbsp;</p><p>Less&nbsp;than&nbsp;3&nbsp;days&nbsp;–&nbsp;100%&nbsp;</p><p>No&nbsp;show&nbsp;–&nbsp;100%&nbsp;</p><p>Unexpected&nbsp;departure&nbsp;–&nbsp;100%</p><p></p><p>Cancellation&nbsp;or&nbsp;modification&nbsp;within&nbsp;45&nbsp;days&nbsp;prior&nbsp;to&nbsp;event:&nbsp;100%&nbsp;reservations&nbsp;cancelled&nbsp;within&nbsp;the&nbsp;schedule&nbsp;as&nbsp;above&nbsp;are&nbsp;subject&nbsp;to&nbsp;a&nbsp;cancellation&nbsp;fee&nbsp;based&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;quoted&nbsp;rates.&nbsp;Non–refundable&nbsp;deposits&nbsp;are&nbsp;not&nbsp;part&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;cancellation&nbsp;policy.</p><p>With&nbsp;this&nbsp;agreement,&nbsp;ile&nbsp;des&nbsp;deux&nbsp;cocos&nbsp;shall&nbsp;not&nbsp;be&nbsp;held&nbsp;responsible&nbsp;and&nbsp;be&nbsp;liable&nbsp;for&nbsp;failure&nbsp;to&nbsp;execute&nbsp;the&nbsp;terms&nbsp;and&nbsp;conditions&nbsp;specified&nbsp;herein&nbsp;directly&nbsp;or&nbsp;indirectly&nbsp;through&nbsp;or&nbsp;in&nbsp;consequence&nbsp;of&nbsp;war,&nbsp;strikes,&nbsp;riots&nbsp;and&nbsp;acts&nbsp;of&nbsp;god&nbsp;beyond&nbsp;the&nbsp;control&nbsp;of&nbsp;ile&nbsp;des&nbsp;deux&nbsp;cocos.&nbsp;Force&nbsp;majeure&nbsp;does&nbsp;not&nbsp;cover&nbsp;the&nbsp;following:&nbsp;economic&nbsp;slowdowns&nbsp;local,&nbsp;regional&nbsp;or&nbsp;global;&nbsp;currency&nbsp;exchange&nbsp;fluctuations;&nbsp;political&nbsp;situations&nbsp;–&nbsp;local,&nbsp;regional&nbsp;or&nbsp;global&nbsp;(this&nbsp;list&nbsp;is&nbsp;not&nbsp;exhaustive)</p>', '<p>50%&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;total&nbsp;amount&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;asked&nbsp;upon&nbsp;confirmation&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;event&nbsp;The&nbsp;difference&nbsp;will&nbsp;have&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;settled&nbsp;30&nbsp;days&nbsp;prior&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;event&nbsp;(45&nbsp;days&nbsp;in&nbsp;peak&nbsp;season)</p>', NULL, 'services/1778740730164-64il78ca8hm.webp', false, 0, 'services/1778742316730-cphorxfcb9j.jpg', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'Île des Deux Cocos is a private Mauritian island offering luxury day trips, snorkeling, beaches, dining, and all-inclusive experiences.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[{"id":"1778742411737","label":"All Inclusive"}]'::jsonb, 'Sea', 0, NULL),
('3856e005-a39f-4064-b2e8-24ab91f3f919', 'Coin de Mire Attitude Hotel', '<p>Situated&nbsp;on&nbsp;Mauritius’s&nbsp;northern&nbsp;tip,&nbsp;the&nbsp;3*+&nbsp;Coin&nbsp;de&nbsp;Mire&nbsp;Attitude&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;enjoys&nbsp;an&nbsp;exceptional&nbsp;position&nbsp;between&nbsp;Grand&nbsp;Baie,&nbsp;an&nbsp;unmissable&nbsp;and&nbsp;lively&nbsp;resort&nbsp;town,&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;picturesque,&nbsp;fishing&nbsp;village&nbsp;of&nbsp;Cap&nbsp;Malheureux.</p><p>Looking&nbsp;straight&nbsp;out&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;island’s&nbsp;surrounding&nbsp;lagoon,&nbsp;Coin&nbsp;de&nbsp;Mire&nbsp;Attitude&nbsp;sits&nbsp;opposite&nbsp;the&nbsp;entrance&nbsp;to&nbsp;sandy&nbsp;Bain&nbsp;Boeuf&nbsp;beach.&nbsp;This&nbsp;peaceful&nbsp;cove&nbsp;offers&nbsp;splendid&nbsp;seas&nbsp;views&nbsp;over&nbsp;colourful&nbsp;fishing&nbsp;boats&nbsp;and&nbsp;turquoise&nbsp;waters&nbsp;towards&nbsp;the&nbsp;iconic&nbsp;coral&nbsp;island&nbsp;of&nbsp;Coin&nbsp;de&nbsp;Mire&nbsp;(or&nbsp;Gunner’s&nbsp;Quoin).</p><p class="ql-align-center"></p><p class="ql-align-center">Check-in&nbsp;time:&nbsp;14:00</p><p class="ql-align-center">Check-&nbsp;out&nbsp;time:&nbsp;12:00</p>', 'Cap Malheureux', 'Mauritius', 4.5, 'services/1777710848372-glrvltmgks.jpg', '["Free Wi-Fi","Laundry (at extra cost)","Free parking","Beach towels and mineral sunscreen available for free","AC in room","Mobile device charging corner available at reception"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-02T08:53:47.937+00:00', '2026-05-12T07:16:41.154+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778137603818-9yquhz2foua.jpg","services/1778137613023-nmz0dtkrh3.jpg","services/1778137619463-e2r2xjyziec.jpg","services/1778137637780-c4bmlxec7ja.jpg","services/1778137649193-m93jezlgmh9.webp","services/1778137662243-h0nddziz69m.webp","services/1778137680612-fz94k2gtpcp.webp"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["Half Board (Breakfast and Dinner)","All Inclusive (Breakfast, Lunch, dinner and L