sp;beyond&nbsp;the&nbsp;control&nbsp;of&nbsp;ile&nbsp;des&nbsp;deux&nbsp;cocos.&nbsp;Force&nbsp;majeure&nbsp;does&nbsp;not&nbsp;cover&nbsp;the&nbsp;following:&nbsp;economic&nbsp;slowdowns&nbsp;local,&nbsp;regional&nbsp;or&nbsp;global;&nbsp;currency&nbsp;exchange&nbsp;fluctuations;&nbsp;political&nbsp;situations&nbsp;–&nbsp;local,&nbsp;regional&nbsp;or&nbsp;global&nbsp;(this&nbsp;list&nbsp;is&nbsp;not&nbsp;exhaustive)</p>', '<p>50%&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;total&nbsp;amount&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;asked&nbsp;upon&nbsp;confirmation&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;event&nbsp;The&nbsp;difference&nbsp;will&nbsp;have&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;settled&nbsp;30&nbsp;days&nbsp;prior&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;event&nbsp;(45&nbsp;days&nbsp;in&nbsp;peak&nbsp;season)</p>', NULL, 'services/1778740730164-64il78ca8hm.webp', false, 0, 'services/1778742316730-cphorxfcb9j.jpg', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'Île des Deux Cocos is a private Mauritian island offering luxury day trips, snorkeling, beaches, dining, and all-inclusive experiences.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[{"id":"1778742411737","label":"All Inclusive"}]'::jsonb, 'Sea', 0, NULL),
