('4ae4458c-973c-4d0c-92ad-5eab115f2e23', 'Le Cardinal Exclusive Resort (From Backup: May 18)', '<p><span style="color: rgb(92, 92, 92); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Le&nbsp;Cardinal&nbsp;Exclusive&nbsp;Resort&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Spa&nbsp;offers&nbsp;the&nbsp;perfect&nbsp;escape&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;hustle&nbsp;and&nbsp;bustle&nbsp;of&nbsp;daily&nbsp;life,&nbsp;providing&nbsp;a&nbsp;serene&nbsp;environment&nbsp;for&nbsp;relaxation&nbsp;as&nbsp;well&nbsp;as&nbsp;exciting&nbsp;activities&nbsp;for&nbsp;those&nbsp;seeking&nbsp;adventure.&nbsp;Nestled&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;tranquil&nbsp;village&nbsp;of&nbsp;Trou&nbsp;aux&nbsp;Biches,&nbsp;the&nbsp;resort&nbsp;boasts&nbsp;a&nbsp;long&nbsp;stretch&nbsp;of&nbsp;pristine&nbsp;white&nbsp;sandy&nbsp;beach.</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(92, 92, 92); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Whether&nbsp;you&#39;re&nbsp;looking&nbsp;to&nbsp;unwind&nbsp;in&nbsp;peaceful&nbsp;surroundings&nbsp;or&nbsp;indulge&nbsp;in&nbsp;more&nbsp;adrenaline-pumping&nbsp;experiences,&nbsp;Le&nbsp;Cardinal&nbsp;caters&nbsp;to&nbsp;all&nbsp;preferences.&nbsp;Conveniently&nbsp;located,&nbsp;the&nbsp;resort&nbsp;is&nbsp;just&nbsp;15&nbsp;km&nbsp;from&nbsp;Port-Louis,&nbsp;the&nbsp;vibrant&nbsp;capital&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;and&nbsp;5&nbsp;km&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;lively&nbsp;town&nbsp;of&nbsp;Grand-Baie.&nbsp;The&nbsp;international&nbsp;airport&nbsp;is&nbsp;situated&nbsp;50&nbsp;km&nbsp;away,&nbsp;ensuring&nbsp;easy&nbsp;access&nbsp;to&nbsp;this&nbsp;tropical&nbsp;haven.</span></p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;12&nbsp;HRS</p><p></p><p>Meal&nbsp;Time:</p><p>•&nbsp;Breakfast:&nbsp;Gastronomic&nbsp;Restaurant&nbsp;(07:00&nbsp;–&nbsp;10:00)</p><p>•&nbsp;Lunch:&nbsp;Gastronomic&nbsp;Restaurant&nbsp;(12:00&nbsp;–&nbsp;13:30)</p><p>•&nbsp;Dinner:&nbsp;Gastronomic&nbsp;Restaurant&nbsp;(19:30&nbsp;–&nbsp;22:00</p> (Imported from backup variant: SQL: seed copy.sql)', 'Trou Aux Biches', 'Ma