('614bfa76-f456-4638-9ade-9a1ecdec7cba', 'Casela Nature Parks (From Backup: May 18)', '<p>Casela&nbsp;Nature&nbsp;Parks&nbsp;is&nbsp;one&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;most&nbsp;popular&nbsp;outdoor&nbsp;attractions&nbsp;in&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;located&nbsp;near&nbsp;the&nbsp;west&nbsp;coast&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;region&nbsp;of&nbsp;Flic&nbsp;en&nbsp;Flac.&nbsp;It&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;large&nbsp;adventure&nbsp;and&nbsp;wildlife&nbsp;park&nbsp;known&nbsp;for&nbsp;its&nbsp;mix&nbsp;of&nbsp;safari&nbsp;experiences,&nbsp;animal&nbsp;encounters,&nbsp;and&nbsp;adrenaline&nbsp;activities.&nbsp;Visitors&nbsp;can&nbsp;see&nbsp;animals&nbsp;such&nbsp;as&nbsp;lions,&nbsp;zebras,&nbsp;giraffes,&nbsp;and&nbsp;various&nbsp;bird&nbsp;species,&nbsp;either&nbsp;on&nbsp;guided&nbsp;safari&nbsp;tours&nbsp;or&nbsp;in&nbsp;more&nbsp;interactive&nbsp;experiences&nbsp;like&nbsp;feeding&nbsp;sessions.&nbsp;Beyond&nbsp;wildlife,&nbsp;Casela&nbsp;also&nbsp;offers&nbsp;activities&nbsp;like&nbsp;zip-lining,&nbsp;quad&nbsp;biking,&nbsp;canyoning,&nbsp;and&nbsp;walking&nbsp;with&nbsp;lions,&nbsp;making&nbsp;it&nbsp;a&nbsp;destination&nbsp;that&nbsp;blends&nbsp;nature,&nbsp;adventure,&nbsp;and&nbsp;family-friendly&nbsp;entertainment&nbsp;in&nbsp;one&nbsp;place.&nbsp;Its&nbsp;scenic&nbsp;views&nbsp;of&nbsp;mountains&nbsp;and&nbsp;coastline&nbsp;add&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;overall&nbsp;experience,&nbsp;making&nbsp;it&nbsp;a&nbsp;must-visit&nbsp;spot&nbsp;for&nbsp;tourists&nbsp;in&nbsp;Mauritius.</p><p></p><p><strong>Opening&nbsp;Hours&nbsp;:&nbsp;Monday&nbsp;to&nbsp;Sunday&nbsp;–&nbsp;9&nbsp;AM&nbsp;to&nbsp;5&nbsp;PM</strong></p><p></p> (Imported from backup variant: JSON: TL_FULL_BACKUP_2026-05-18T08-17-19-209Z.json)', 'Cascavelle', 'West Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778919821391-lwao438bb3.jpg', '["Wifi","toilet","attraction","activities","4D Cinema","Kids’ playground areas","Souvenir shops","Shuttle transport inside the park","Restaurants & cafés"]'::jsonb, 'activity', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:17:46.2120