('66dd0494-622f-4390-9a0c-378728046008', 'Water Activities at Belle Mare Beach', '<p>At&nbsp;Belle&nbsp;Mare&nbsp;Beach,&nbsp;water&nbsp;activities&nbsp;like&nbsp;tube&nbsp;rides,&nbsp;parasailing,&nbsp;and&nbsp;undersea&nbsp;walking&nbsp;offer&nbsp;a&nbsp;mix&nbsp;of&nbsp;excitement&nbsp;and&nbsp;discovery,&nbsp;where&nbsp;tube&nbsp;rides&nbsp;bring&nbsp;fast,&nbsp;splashy&nbsp;thrills&nbsp;across&nbsp;the&nbsp;lagoon,&nbsp;parasailing&nbsp;provides&nbsp;stunning&nbsp;aerial&nbsp;views&nbsp;over&nbsp;the&nbsp;turquoise&nbsp;ocean,&nbsp;and&nbsp;undersea&nbsp;walks&nbsp;allow&nbsp;you&nbsp;to&nbsp;explore&nbsp;coral&nbsp;reefs&nbsp;and&nbsp;marine&nbsp;life&nbsp;up&nbsp;close&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;safe,&nbsp;guided&nbsp;experience.</p>', 'Belle Mare', 'East Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778919053527-qy6spely1e.jpg', '["Parasailing","Tube Rides","Undersea walk"]'::jsonb, 'activity', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-16T08:11:02.742+00:00', '2026-05-16T08:11:02.742+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778918789481-bno1tffrfs4.jpg","services/1778918802177-a1je8qzxt5.jpg","services/1778918819614-3yo6rye2i8w.jpg","services/1778918829536-m7qprkca6x.jpg","services/1778918857610-pe6vb4jw3gg.jpg","services/1778919022546-c628s0gidd.jpg","services/1778919033100-coso3t2mp3l.webp"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'services/1778918771715-nkknqlejpc.jpg', false, 0, 'services/1778918762996-6lx23b8pd8t.jpg', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'At Belle Mare Beach, tube rides, parasailing, and undersea walks offer thrilling marine adventures.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[]'::jsonb, 'Sea', 0, NULL),
('6741319c-686c-4002-841e-e4e09d075a74', 'The Ravenala Attitude (From Backup: May 20)', '<p>It’s&nbsp;an&nbsp;exotic&nbsp;journey&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;heart&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius.&nbsp;Nestled&nbsp;between&nbsp;the&nbsp;sea,&nbsp;river,&nbsp;and&nbsp;mountains,&nbsp;The&nbsp;Ravenala&nbsp;Attitude&nbsp;4*&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;true&nbsp;open-air&nbsp;tropical&nbsp;garden.&nbsp;The&nbsp;setting&nbsp;is&nbsp;established&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;atmosphere&nbsp;follows:&nbsp;life&nbsp;flows&nbsp;seamlessly&nbsp;between&nbsp;indoors&nbsp;and&nbsp;outdoors,&nbsp;whether&nbsp;you’re&nbsp;there&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;couple,&nbsp;with&nbsp;family,&nbsp;or&nbsp;with&nbsp;friends—and&nbsp;you&nbsp;simply&nbsp;feel&nbsp;good…&nbsp;naturally.</p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS&nbsp;</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;12&nbsp;HRS</p> (Imported from backup variant: SQL: seed_2026-05-16.sql)', 'Balaclava', 'Mauritius', 4.5, 'services/1777701345363-ge6iarxcd08.jpg', '["Free wifi","Parking","swimming pool","Currency exchange at the reception","Beach Towel","Restaurant & Bar","kids club","spa","local shop","entertainment","gym","activities"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:16:25.479253+00:00', '2026-05-20T04:16:25.479253+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1777701394989-71h2lktfx0p.webp","services/1777701417581-vmx64511b4.jpg","services/1777701438570-sii978r8rn.jpg","services/1777701447937-519doxsvxgm.jpg","services/1777701456482-jgc6rnkpqkm.jpg","services/1777701475733-stpekni018.jpg","services/1777701484251-g5d6v1pvuh5.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '<p>Cancellation&nbsp;Policy</p><p>The&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;cancellation&nbsp;policy&nbsp;shall&nbsp;be&nbsp;as&nbsp;follows&nbsp;:</p><p>Cancellation&nbsp;date/period&nbsp;</p><p>Rate&nbsp;payable</p><p>Between&nbsp;D-7&nbsp;and&nbsp;D-4:&nbsp;50%&nbsp;of&nbsp;total&nbsp;rate&nbsp;payable</p><p>Between&nbsp;D-3&nbsp;and&nbsp;D-1:&nbsp;80%&nbsp;of&nbsp;total&nbsp;rate&nbsp;payable</p><p>Peak&nbsp;season&nbsp;between&nbsp;D-30&nbsp;and&nbsp;D-1:&nbsp;100%&nbsp;of&nbsp;total&nbsp;rate&nbsp;payable</p><p>No&nbsp;shows:&nbsp;100%&nbsp;of&nbsp;total&nbsp;rate&nbsp;payable</p><p>Unexpected&nbsp;departure:&nbsp;No&nbsp;refund.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>Rates&nbsp;are&nbsp;in&nbsp;MUR&nbsp;per&nbsp;room&nbsp;per&nbsp;night&nbsp;on&nbsp;&#39;Half&nbsp;Board&#39;&nbsp;basis&nbsp;[&nbsp;Breakfast&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Dinner&nbsp;].</p><p></p><p>Children&nbsp;who&nbsp;are&nbsp;less&nbsp;than&nbsp;3&nbsp;years&nbsp;old&nbsp;are&nbsp;FOC&nbsp;on&nbsp;parents&nbsp;meal&nbsp;plan&nbsp;booked.</p><p></p><p>Single&nbsp;Parent&nbsp;Policy&nbsp;:&nbsp;1&nbsp;Adult&nbsp;+&nbsp;1&nbsp;Child&nbsp;/&nbsp;Teen&nbsp;=&nbsp;Pays&nbsp;2&nbsp;*&nbsp;1/2&nbsp;Double.</p><p></p><p>A&nbsp;minimum&nbsp;of&nbsp;2&nbsp;children/teens&nbsp;is&nbsp;required&nbsp;per&nbsp;Suite&nbsp;for&nbsp;children/teens&nbsp;in&nbsp;their&nbsp;own&nbsp;Suite.</p><p></p><p>Minimum&nbsp;of&nbsp;2-night&nbsp;stay&nbsp;for&nbsp;All&nbsp;inclusive&nbsp;basis&nbsp;and&nbsp;Half&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Full&nbsp;board&nbsp;basis&nbsp;for&nbsp;1&nbsp;night&nbsp;stay.</p>', NULL, 'services/1777701360093-9rs2tvgzvsn.jpg', false, 0, 'services/1777701373024-xg8njmezay.webp', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'The hotel is located right next to the village of Balaclava and its peaceful beach. The water is clear, the sand is warm, and the atmosphere is serene. Grand Baie is just 15 minutes away for strolling through shops and enjoying the nightlife, while Port Louis is 20 minutes away, known for its vibrant and colorful market.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[{"id":"1777959156787","label":"Half Board"},{"id":"1777959165269","label":"All Inclusive"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 0, NULL),
('67b2a57d-ba0b-426a-96ce-d7db9f7d932b', 'Aanari Hotel and Spa (From Backup: May 18)', '<p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgba(66, 66, 66, 0.8);">Rooted&nbsp;in&nbsp;Chinese,&nbsp;Indian&nbsp;and&nbsp;Creole&nbsp;traditions,&nbsp;Aanari&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;reflection&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius&nbsp;itself&nbsp;—&nbsp;a&nbsp;place&nbsp;where&nbsp;cultures&nbsp;blend&nbsp;seamlessly.&nbsp;Fifty&nbsp;rooms&nbsp;across&nbsp;two&nbsp;wings,&nbsp;steps&nbsp;from&nbsp;one&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;island&#39;s&nbsp;finest&nbsp;beaches,&nbsp;with&nbsp;front-row&nbsp;seats&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;west&nbsp;coast&nbsp;sunset.</span></p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;11&nbsp;HRS</p> (Imported from backup variant: SQL: seed.sql)', 'Flic en Flac', 'West Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778227772690-oupewrj9qf.webp', '["Free Wifi","Outdoor swimming pool","Restaurant and Bar","Fitness & Wellness","spa","beachfront"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:26:25.625693+00:00', '2026-05-20T04:26:25.625693+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778219922331-w328z00zcir.jpg","services/1778219932615-9xti7ibp9xi.jpg","services/1778219937898-lfl5x2jitkd.jpg","services/1778219945505-abe9vi2ocgq.webp","services/1778219952338-yfsnwd8m48l.jpg","services/1778219965486-lteevniljss.jpg","services/1778219975697-lpxjdxqktq.webp","services/1778219989061-9nnuudh7lv.jpg","services/1778219997705-bhqoy434c3k.jpg","services/1778220012244-hym4gpx1u1n.webp"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'services/1778227805480-zjuhycjixm.jpg', false, 0, 'services/1778227812327-eueq4zna91c.jpg', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'Beachside Mauritian hotel with spa, sunsets, and multicultural dining experiences.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 0, NULL),
('681c41f9-a745-4890-9c62-4887cef117c0', 'Tropical Attitude (From Backup: May 19)', '<p><span style="color: rgb(16, 76, 82); background-color: rgb(248, 253, 254);">At&nbsp;Tropical&nbsp;Attitude,&nbsp;time&nbsp;becomes&nbsp;wonderfully&nbsp;irrelevant&nbsp;–&nbsp;and&nbsp;that’s&nbsp;exactly&nbsp;its&nbsp;charm.&nbsp;Every&nbsp;room&nbsp;at&nbsp;this&nbsp;intimate&nbsp;boutique&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;opens&nbsp;up&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;sea.&nbsp;Your&nbsp;days&nbsp;here&nbsp;follow&nbsp;the&nbsp;tide,&nbsp;the&nbsp;moving&nbsp;shade&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;coconut&nbsp;palms,&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;daily&nbsp;routines&nbsp;of&nbsp;local&nbsp;fishermen.</span></p><p></p><p><span style="color: rgb(16, 76, 82); background-color: rgb(248, 253, 254);">So&nbsp;hit&nbsp;‘pause’.&nbsp;Breathe&nbsp;out.&nbsp;And&nbsp;slip&nbsp;into&nbsp;the&nbsp;laid-back&nbsp;rhythm&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;East&nbsp;Coast.</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(16, 76, 82); background-color: rgb(248, 253, 254);">After&nbsp;all,&nbsp;isn’t&nbsp;that&nbsp;what&nbsp;holidays&nbsp;are&nbsp;for?</span></p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;12&nbsp;HRS</p> (Imported from backup variant: SQL: seed_2026-05-19.sql)', 'Trou d''eau Douces', 'East Coast', 4.5, 'services/1777707575883-pcbzeqrgch.jpg', '["Free wifi ","laundry services","swimming pool","bar & restaurant","Foreign currency exchange","Lounge","parking","land activities","water activities","Open Air Cinema","Evening Entertainment","spa","outdoor gym"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:15:55.763497+00:00', '2026-05-20T04:15:55.763497+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1777708193771-w3tl00ew4vs.webp","services/1777708209218-j6rp8imogj.jpg","services/1777708216994-pdoc5q4735q.jpg","services/1777708232868-v4hmky3ywyl.webp","services/1777708252998-n7icstes56b.jpg","services/1777708261262-8bnma56uxqr.jpg","services/1777708292820-0xqperfazoqb.webp","services/17