('75bfdd21-e8af-4cb4-ac8a-d180331ac429', 'Zilwa Attitude (From Backup: May 19)', '<p>Need&nbsp;to&nbsp;let&nbsp;off&nbsp;steam&nbsp;or&nbsp;recharge&nbsp;your&nbsp;batteries?&nbsp;Want&nbsp;to&nbsp;practice&nbsp;an&nbsp;activity&nbsp;on&nbsp;dry&nbsp;land&nbsp;or&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;water?&nbsp;At&nbsp;4*&nbsp;Zilwa&nbsp;Attitude&nbsp;hotel,&nbsp;give&nbsp;free&nbsp;rein&nbsp;to&nbsp;your&nbsp;desires&nbsp;and&nbsp;your&nbsp;curiosity.&nbsp;You&nbsp;can&nbsp;try&nbsp;stand-up&nbsp;paddleboarding,&nbsp;water&nbsp;aerobics,&nbsp;tennis&nbsp;or&nbsp;even&nbsp;tai&nbsp;chi.&nbsp;There&nbsp;are&nbsp;a&nbsp;wide&nbsp;range&nbsp;of&nbsp;activities&nbsp;available&nbsp;for&nbsp;your&nbsp;relaxation&nbsp;and&nbsp;pleasure,&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;added&nbsp;bonus&nbsp;of&nbsp;exploring&nbsp;the&nbsp;superb&nbsp;lagoon!</p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;12&nbsp;HRS</p> (Imported from backup variant: SQL: seed_2026-05-19.sql)', 'Calodyne', 'Mauritius', 4.5, 'services/1777702743614-letpgw4nwu.jpg', '["Free wifi","laundry services","Beach towels","Baby changing room","Foreign currency exchange service","Local shop","Computer with Internet access","spa","restaurant","swimming pool","Water activities","gym","entertainment","board games","Land Activities","kids activities"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:16:33.555005+00:00', '2026-05-20T04:16:33.555005+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1777702779794-cfesxst5v6.jpg","services/1777702786264-pc3guj0r3i.jpg","services/1777702889430-rj8h6ot5tak.jpg","services/1777702896481-ybhj69oefv.jpg","services/1777702904290-px0cix31gj.jpg","services/1777703046311-66e1pdt4508.jpg","services/1777703149335-bpr39onsts.jpg","services/1777703158030-0wv9ywkaxk1a.jpg","services/1777703174337-8w1e3er2wbl.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '<p>Cancellation&nbsp;Policy</p><p>The&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;cancellation&nbsp;policy&nbsp;shall&nbsp;be&nbsp;as&nbsp;follows&nbsp;:</p><p>Cancellation&nbsp;date/period&nbsp;</p><p>Rate&nbsp;payable</p><p>Between&nbsp;D-7&nbsp;and&nbsp;D-4:&nbsp;50%&nbsp;of&nbsp;total&nbsp;rate&nbsp;payable</p><p>Between&nbsp;D-3&nbsp;and&nbsp;D-1:&nbsp;80%&nbsp;of&nbsp;total&nbsp;rate&nbsp;payable</p><p>Peak&nbsp;season&nbsp;between&nbsp;D-30&nbsp;and&nbsp;D-1:&nbsp;100%&nbsp;of&nbsp;total&nbsp;rate&nbsp;payable</p><p>No&nbsp;shows:&nbsp;100%&nbsp;of&nbsp;total&nbsp;rate&nbsp;payable</p><p>Unexpected&nbsp;departure:&nbsp;No&nbsp;refund.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>Rates&nbsp;are&nbsp;in&nbsp;MUR&nbsp;per&nbsp;room&nbsp;per&nbsp;night&nbsp;on&nbsp;&#39;Half&nbsp;Board&#39;&nbsp;basis&nbsp;[&nbsp;Breakfast&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Dinner&nbsp;].</p><p></p><p>Children&nbsp;who&nbsp;are&nbsp;less&nbsp;than&nbsp;3&nbsp;years&nbsp;old&nbsp;are&nbsp;FOC&nbsp;on&nbsp;parents&nbsp;meal&nbsp;plan&nbsp;booked.</p><p></p><p>A&nbsp;minimum&nbsp;of&nbsp;2&nbsp;children/teens&nbsp;is&nbsp;required&nbsp;per&nbsp;room&nbsp;for&nbsp;children/teens&nbsp;in&nbsp;their&nbsp;own&nbsp;room.</p><p></p><p>Single&nbsp;Parent&nbsp;Policy&nbsp;:&nbsp;1&nbsp;Adult&nbsp;+&nbsp;1&nbsp;Child&nbsp;/&nbsp;Teen&nbsp;=&nbsp;Pays&nbsp;2&nbsp;*&nbsp;1/2&nbsp;Double.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Minimum&nbsp;of&nbsp;2-night&nbsp;stay&nbsp;for&nbsp;All&nbsp;inclusive&nbsp;basis&nbsp;and&nbsp;Half&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Full&nbsp;board&nbsp;basis&nbsp;for&nbsp;1&nbsp;night&nbsp;stay</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 'services/1777702732354-ku5rihge00i.jpg', false, 0, 'services/1777702763969-pt1h3a3ybot.webp', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'Zilwa Attitude is a relaxed beachfront hotel in Mauritius with a local island vibe, offering simple comfort, good food, and beautiful lagoon views.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[{"id":"1777895854877","label":"Half Board"},{"id":"1777895866328","label":"All Inclusive"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 0, NULL),
('75c95246-d1b0-4a1a-aa06-279fb9dc09e3', 'Full-Day Catamaran Trip to Gabriel Island', '<p>Île&nbsp;aux&nbsp;Gabriel&nbsp;catamaran&nbsp;trips&nbsp;are&nbsp;among&nbsp;the&nbsp;most&nbsp;scenic&nbsp;experiences&nbsp;in&nbsp;northern&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;combining&nbsp;island&nbsp;hopping,&nbsp;snorkeling,&nbsp;and&nbsp;relaxing&nbsp;sailing&nbsp;across&nbsp;clear&nbsp;lagoon&nbsp;waters.</p><p>The&nbsp;route&nbsp;often&nbsp;includes&nbsp;stops&nbsp;at&nbsp;Île&nbsp;Plate,&nbsp;known&nbsp;for&nbsp;its&nbsp;long&nbsp;sandy&nbsp;beaches&nbsp;and&nbsp;shallow&nbsp;turquoise&nbsp;waters&nbsp;ideal&nbsp;for&nbsp;swimming.&nbsp;Boats&nbsp;also&nbsp;pass&nbsp;near&nbsp;Coin&nbsp;de&nbsp;Mire,&nbsp;a&nbsp;dramatic&nbsp;rocky&nbsp;islet&nbsp;popular&nbsp;for&nbsp;birdlife&nbsp;and&nbsp;photography.</p><p>Onboard,&nbsp;visitors&nbsp;typically&nbsp;enjoy&nbsp;barbecue&nbsp;lunches,&nbsp;music,&nbsp;and&nbsp;sunbathing&nbsp;on&nbsp;deck&nbsp;while&nbsp;cruising&nbsp;between&nbsp;islands.&nbsp;The&nbsp;calm&nbsp;northern&nbsp;sea&nbsp;conditions&nbsp;make&nbsp;it&nbsp;suitable&nbsp;for&nbsp;families,&nbsp;while&nbsp;the&nbsp;coral&nbsp;reefs&nbsp;offer&nbsp;frequent&nbsp;sightings&nbsp;of&nbsp;colorful&nbsp;fish&nbsp;and&nbsp;marine&nbsp;biodiversity&nbsp;during&nbsp;snorkeling&nbsp;stops.</p>', 'Balaclava', 'North Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778911832092-jtute24pzyi.jpg', '["BBQ LUNCH","SOFT DRINKS & ALCOHOL","MUSIC & ENTERTAINMENT","SNORKELING"]'::jsonb, 'activity', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-16T06:17:26.268+00:00', '2026-05-16T06:25:35.832+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778911952045-9883kjpvx1.jpg","services/1778911967429-o3f9sl0zhog.jpg","services/1778911974189-p6mhb1ujszh.webp","services/1778911989555-a890j6kx1wt.jpg","services/1778912015282-spqhs21awz.jpg","services/1778912040356-fez491ihew.jpg","services/1778912095929-4cgf0nvhzku.jpg","services/1778912406790-6gozqx5n3dr.jpg","services/1778912730015-4ha4f2ntqlq.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', N