('82bc9ee8-d060-405d-89ff-89b7ae338f30', 'Zilwa Attitude (From Backup: May 18)', '<p>Need&nbsp;to&nbsp;let&nbsp;off&nbsp;steam&nbsp;or&nbsp;recharge&nbsp;your&nbsp;batteries?&nbsp;Want&nbsp;to&nbsp;practice&nbsp;an&nbsp;activity&nbsp;on&nbsp;dry&nbsp;land&nbsp;or&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;water?&nbsp;At&nbsp;4*&nbsp;Zilwa&nbsp;Attitude&nbsp;hotel,&nbsp;give&nbsp;free&nbsp;rein&nbsp;to&nbsp;your&nbsp;desires&nbsp;and&nbsp;your&nbsp;curiosity.&nbsp;You&nbsp;can&nbsp;try&nbsp;stand-up&nbsp;paddleboarding,&nbsp;water&nbsp;aerobics,&nbsp;tennis&nbsp;or&nbsp;even&nbsp;tai&nbsp;chi.&nbsp;There&nbsp;are&nbsp;a&nbsp;wide&nbsp;range&nbsp;of&nbsp;activities&nbsp;available&nbsp;for&nbsp;your&nbsp;relaxation&nbsp;and&nbsp;pleasure,&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;added&nbsp;bonus&nbsp;of&nbsp;exploring&nbsp;the&nbsp;superb&nbsp;lagoon!</p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;12&nbsp;HRS</p> (Imported from backup variant: SQL: seed copy.sql)', 'Calodyne', 'Mauritius', 4.5, 'services/1777702743614-letpgw4nwu.jpg', '["Free wifi","laundry services","Beach towels","Baby changing room","Foreign currency exchange service","Local shop","Computer with Internet access","spa","restaurant","swimming pool","Water activities","gym","entertainment","board games","Land Activities","kids activities"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:16:37.340792+00:00', '2026-05-20T04:16:37.340792+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1777702779794-cfesxst5v6.jpg","services/1777702786264-pc3guj0r3i.jpg","services/1777702889430-rj8h6ot5tak.jpg","services/1777702896481-ybhj69oefv.jpg","services/1777702904290-px0cix31gj.jpg","services/1777703046311-66e1pdt4508.jpg","services/1777703149335-bpr39onsts.jpg","services/1777703158030-0wv9ywkaxk1a.jpg","services/1777703174337-8w1e3er2wbl.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '<p>Cancellation&nbsp;Policy</p><p>The&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;cance