('8485789b-e4d3-4849-b9d4-a50493a773df', 'Casuarina Resort and Spa (From Backup: May 18)', '<p><span style="color: rgb(92, 92, 92); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Nestled&nbsp;along&nbsp;a&nbsp;private&nbsp;beach&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;picturesque&nbsp;Trou&nbsp;aux&nbsp;Biches,&nbsp;Casuarina&nbsp;Resort&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Spa&nbsp;offers&nbsp;the&nbsp;ultimate&nbsp;tropical&nbsp;escape&nbsp;with&nbsp;an&nbsp;outdoor&nbsp;pool,&nbsp;luxurious&nbsp;wellness&nbsp;center,&nbsp;and&nbsp;world-class&nbsp;dining.</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(92, 92, 92); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Guests&nbsp;can&nbsp;choose&nbsp;from&nbsp;elegantly&nbsp;designed&nbsp;rooms&nbsp;and&nbsp;bungalows,&nbsp;each&nbsp;equipped&nbsp;with&nbsp;modern&nbsp;amenities&nbsp;like&nbsp;air&nbsp;conditioning,&nbsp;satellite&nbsp;TV,&nbsp;and&nbsp;private&nbsp;bathrooms.</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(92, 92, 92); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Located&nbsp;just&nbsp;12&nbsp;miles&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;vibrant&nbsp;capital,&nbsp;Port&nbsp;Louis,&nbsp;this&nbsp;resort&nbsp;blends&nbsp;relaxation&nbsp;with&nbsp;adventure,&nbsp;making&nbsp;it&nbsp;an&nbsp;ideal&nbsp;choice&nbsp;for&nbsp;travelers&nbsp;seeking&nbsp;a&nbsp;memorable&nbsp;Mauritian&nbsp;getaway.</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(92, 92, 92); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Select&nbsp;accommodations&nbsp;also&nbsp;feature&nbsp;private&nbsp;balconies&nbsp;or&nbsp;terraces,&nbsp;offering&nbsp;stunning&nbsp;views&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;surroundings.</span></p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;12&nbsp;HRS</p> (Imported from backup variant: JSON: TL_FULL_BACKUP_2026-05-18T08-17-19-209Z.json)', 'Trou Aux Biches', 'Mauritius', 4.5, 'services/1777551247221-nwk1tuvbbh.jpg', '["Free Wifi","Free Activities ","gym","spa","Free Secured parking","kids club","swimming pool","Free water sport","restaurant & bar"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04