('95548034-05d1-4ab3-8ccd-52b163542515', 'Le Morne Peak Challenge', 'Scale the majestic Le Morne Brabant, a UNESCO World Heritage site and a symbol of freedom and resilience. This challenging yet rewarding hike takes you through rocky terrain and steep ridges, culminating in one of the most spectacular viewpoints in the world. From the summit cross, enjoy breathtaking 360-degree views of the famous ''underwater waterfall'' illusion and the turquoise lagoons of the South-West. Our expert guides share the historical significance of the mountain while ensuring your safety on the trail. This hike is a must for active travelers seeking a spiritual and visual highlight of their visit to Mauritius.', 'Le Morne', 'South-West', 4.9, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1563492065599-3520f775eeed', '["Safety Gear","Guide","Panoramic Views"]'::jsonb, 'activity', NULL, 4, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:29:19.183891+00:00', '2026-05-20T04:29:19.183891+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, 0, NULL, false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'Hike the iconic UNESCO World Heritage site peak.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 0, NULL),
