('b839d497-ab1b-4e13-950e-f7a1eacc12c5', 'Dubai & Malaysia Group Tour  - Price Variant', '<ul><li>Air&nbsp;Ticket&nbsp;With&nbsp;Emirates&nbsp;</li><li>4&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;At&nbsp;Hyatt&nbsp;Place&nbsp;Al&nbsp;Wasl,&nbsp;4★&nbsp;Or&nbsp;Similar&nbsp;</li><li>7&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;Stay&nbsp;At&nbsp;Royal&nbsp;Hotel&nbsp;,&nbsp;4★&nbsp;Or&nbsp;Similar&nbsp;</li><li>Daily&nbsp;Breakfast&nbsp;</li><li>Return&nbsp;Airport&nbsp;Transfer&nbsp;</li><li>Desert&nbsp;Safari&nbsp;With&nbsp;Bbq&nbsp;Dinner&nbsp;Including&nbsp;Return&nbsp;Transfer&nbsp;</li><li>Half&nbsp;Day&nbsp;City&nbsp;Tour&nbsp;Including&nbsp;Return&nbsp;Transfer&nbsp;</li><li>Half&nbsp;Day&nbsp;Batu&nbsp;Caves&nbsp;And&nbsp;City&nbsp;Tour&nbsp;Including&nbsp;Return&nbsp;Transfer&nbsp;</li><li>Full&nbsp;Day&nbsp;Genting&nbsp;Highland&nbsp;Including&nbsp;Cable&nbsp;Car&nbsp;Ticket&nbsp;And&nbsp;Return&nbsp;Transfer&nbsp;</li></ul><pre data-language="plain">
