('bb867a41-8510-4fd8-acf0-f3e49343e640', 'Laguna Hotel & Spa', '<p><span style="color: rgb(126, 126, 126); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Nestled&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;unspoilt&nbsp;peninsula&nbsp;along&nbsp;the&nbsp;South&nbsp;East&nbsp;Coast&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius,</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(126, 126, 126); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">the&nbsp;</span><strong style="color: rgb(126, 126, 126); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Laguna&nbsp;Beach&nbsp;Hotel&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Spa,</strong><span style="color: rgb(126, 126, 126); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;a&nbsp;cosy&nbsp;and&nbsp;charming&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;invites&nbsp;you&nbsp;to&nbsp;discover&nbsp;the&nbsp;wildest&nbsp;landscapes&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;Island&nbsp;and&nbsp;its&nbsp;preserved&nbsp;Flaura&nbsp;and&nbsp;Fauna.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(126, 126, 126); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">From&nbsp;turquoise-blue&nbsp;water&nbsp;to&nbsp;impressive&nbsp;ravines,&nbsp;spectacular&nbsp;waterfalls,&nbsp;mountainous&nbsp;terrains&nbsp;offering&nbsp;magnificent&nbsp;panorama&nbsp;and&nbsp;historical&nbsp;sites,</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(126, 126, 126); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">the&nbsp;region’s&nbsp;simplicity&nbsp;and&nbsp;tranquil&nbsp;atmosphere&nbsp;make&nbsp;up&nbsp;all&nbsp;its&nbsp;charm.</span></p><p></p><p>Check&nbsp;in&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;hrs</p><p>Check&nbsp;out&nbsp;:&nbsp;11&nbsp;hrs</p>', ' Camp des Pecheurs,Grand River South East', 'East Coast', 4.5, 'services/1777548302443-4gabojctdo2.jpg', '[]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30T11:27:41.076+00:00', '2026-05-02T07:40:38.819+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1777548354621-3ni2b469o0r.jpg","services/1777548369791-xejtm5ncce.jpg","services/1777548379985-kv8lkmoz9vc.jpg","services/1777548391844-ne9ws0mtzdf.jpg","services/1777548413698-6s8kftkkclx.jpg","services/1777548430849-x50255uhqy.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', ''