('bec44cfc-eddc-4015-ae6f-1db840f3a8c0', 'Wonders Beach Boutique Hotel (From Backup: May 18)', '<p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Wonders&nbsp;Beach&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;newly&nbsp;built,&nbsp;elegant,&nbsp;and&nbsp;innovative&nbsp;resort.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">It&nbsp;has&nbsp;been&nbsp;designed&nbsp;for&nbsp;its&nbsp;guests&nbsp;to&nbsp;fully&nbsp;experience&nbsp;and&nbsp;enjoy&nbsp;the&nbsp;state-of-the-art&nbsp;service,&nbsp;sophisticated&nbsp;amenities&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;variety&nbsp;of&nbsp;activities.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">The&nbsp;large&nbsp;variety&nbsp;of&nbsp;first-class&nbsp;rooms&nbsp;have&nbsp;an&nbsp;unbeatable&nbsp;view&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;turquoise&nbsp;lagoon&nbsp;of&nbsp;&nbsp;Mon&nbsp;Choisy&nbsp;with&nbsp;dedicated&nbsp;service&nbsp;and&nbsp;genuine&nbsp;hospitality.</span></p><p>Our&nbsp;mission&nbsp;is&nbsp;to&nbsp;make&nbsp;your&nbsp;stay&nbsp;in&nbsp;Mauritius&nbsp;simply&nbsp;memorable,&nbsp;unforgettable.</p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14HRS</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;11HRS</p> (Imported from backup variant: SQL: seed.sql)', 'Mont Choisy', 'North Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778229280786-v9w1n78h8u.jpg', '["free wifi","Swimming Pool","Private beach","24-hour services","24-hour reception","outdoor swimming pool","Spa & Wellness","Gym","Restaurant & Bar"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:26:26.134718+00:00', '2026-05-20T04:26:26.134718+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778228654103-tdjkyc7dbl.jpg","services/1778228668180-8kahs77ankh.jpg","services/1778228678259-boeb1gb7nl9.jpg","services/1778228691066-4cwoxcvupii.jpg","services/1778228699238-r98simgp2im.jpg","services/1778228706609-9yuuvobps0b.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'service