('c9a2186a-a097-4d81-bd38-c0dca4459d11', 'Water Activities at Belle Mare Beach (From Backup: May 19)', '<p>At&nbsp;Belle&nbsp;Mare&nbsp;Beach,&nbsp;water&nbsp;activities&nbsp;like&nbsp;tube&nbsp;rides,&nbsp;parasailing,&nbsp;and&nbsp;undersea&nbsp;walking&nbsp;offer&nbsp;a&nbsp;mix&nbsp;of&nbsp;excitement&nbsp;and&nbsp;discovery,&nbsp;where&nbsp;tube&nbsp;rides&nbsp;bring&nbsp;fast,&nbsp;splashy&nbsp;thrills&nbsp;across&nbsp;the&nbsp;lagoon,&nbsp;parasailing&nbsp;provides&nbsp;stunning&nbsp;aerial&nbsp;views&nbsp;over&nbsp;the&nbsp;turquoise&nbsp;ocean,&nbsp;and&nbsp;undersea&nbsp;walks&nbsp;allow&nbsp;you&nbsp;to&nbsp;explore&nbsp;coral&nbsp;reefs&nbsp;and&nbsp;marine&nbsp;life&nbsp;up&nbsp;close&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;safe,&nbsp;guided&nbsp;experience.</p> (Imported from backup variant: SQL: seed_2026-05-19.sql)', 'Belle Mare', 'East Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778919053527-qy6spely1e.jpg', '["Parasailing","Tube Rides","Undersea walk"]'::jsonb, 'activity', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:18:01.245127+00:00', '2026-05-20T04:18:01.245127+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778918789481-bno1tffrfs4.jpg","services/1778918802177-a1je8qzxt5.jpg","services/1778918819614-3yo6rye2i8w.jpg","services/1778918829536-m7qprkca6x.jpg","services/1778918857610-pe6vb4jw3gg.jpg","services/1778919022546-c628s0gidd.jpg","services/1778919033100-coso3t2mp3l.webp"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'services/1779081781800-i8gobbtrjwg.jpg', false, 0, 'services/1778918762996-6lx23b8pd8t.jpg', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'At Belle Mare Beach, tube rides, parasailing, and undersea walks offer thrilling marine adventures.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[]'::jsonb, 'Sea', 0, NULL),
