('cbd9f139-d037-4dca-85fb-26ba337319ba', 'Wild West Exploration (Different Pricing)', '<p>Venture&nbsp;off&nbsp;the&nbsp;beaten&nbsp;path&nbsp;to&nbsp;discover&nbsp;the&nbsp;raw,&nbsp;untouched&nbsp;beauty&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;Mauritian&nbsp;West.&nbsp;From&nbsp;the&nbsp;historic&nbsp;salt&nbsp;pans&nbsp;of&nbsp;Tamarin&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;rugged&nbsp;basalt&nbsp;cliffs&nbsp;of&nbsp;Maconde,&nbsp;this&nbsp;tour&nbsp;captures&nbsp;the&nbsp;authentic&nbsp;soul&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;island&nbsp;away&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;bustling&nbsp;resort&nbsp;crowds.&nbsp;Explore&nbsp;the&nbsp;unique&nbsp;geography&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;volcanic&nbsp;coastline,&nbsp;visit&nbsp;charming&nbsp;fishing&nbsp;villages,&nbsp;and&nbsp;learn&nbsp;about&nbsp;the&nbsp;local&nbsp;culture&nbsp;and&nbsp;heritage&nbsp;from&nbsp;our&nbsp;resident&nbsp;guides.&nbsp;This&nbsp;exploration&nbsp;is&nbsp;designed&nbsp;for&nbsp;travelers&nbsp;who&nbsp;want&nbsp;to&nbsp;see&nbsp;the&nbsp;real&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;offering&nbsp;a&nbsp;mix&nbsp;of&nbsp;stunning&nbsp;scenery,&nbsp;history,&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;genuine&nbsp;warmth&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;people&nbsp;who&nbsp;call&nbsp;this&nbsp;coast&nbsp;home.</p> (With different pricing variants)', NULL, NULL, 4.5, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-19T16:22:58.078+00:00', '2026-05-19T16:22:58.078+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, 0, NULL, false, 'Limited Time', true, false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 12, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 0, NULL),
('cc048a17-ed96-4e01-9640-c855954bcb51', 'Ocean''s Creek Beach Hotel', '<p><span style="background-color: rgb(254, 254, 254); color: rgb(103, 105, 118);">Managed&nbsp;by&nbsp;Shanti&nbsp;Hospitality,&nbsp;Ocean&#39;s&nbsp;Creek&nbsp;Beach&nbsp;Hotel&nbsp;has&nbsp;nested&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;coastal&nbsp;northwest&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;near&nbsp;Balaclava.&nbsp;With&nbsp;its&nbsp;strategic&nbsp;location,&nbsp;the&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;is&nbsp;accessible&nbsp;to&nbsp;every&nbsp;part&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;discovering&nbsp;the&nbsp;culture&nbsp;and&nbsp;nature&nbsp;experience&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;island.&nbsp;The&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;offers&nbsp;splendid&nbsp;view&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;Tombeau&nbsp;River&nbsp;and&nbsp;Le&nbsp;Goulet&nbsp;Beach,&nbsp;offering&nbsp;a&nbsp;warm&nbsp;sunset&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;end&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;day.&nbsp;With&nbsp;365&nbsp;days&nbsp;of&nbsp;versatile&nbsp;fun,&nbsp;Ocean&#39;s&nbsp;Creek&nbsp;ensures&nbsp;a&nbsp;vibrant&nbsp;guest&nbsp;experience&nbsp;with&nbsp;its&nbsp;team.</span></p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;11&nbsp;HRS</p> (Imported from JSON backup: TL_FULL_BACKUP_2026-05-18T08-17-19-209Z.json)', 'Balaclava', 'Mauritius', 4.5, 'services/1777544979317-7689fp46j2w.jpg', '["Wifi ","In-house Cinema"," Laundry service","spa","gym","Up to 50 parking places and coach parking","Water Leisure - Pool & Jacuzzi","Kids Club","Indoor & Outdoor Activities"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-19T16:13:29.375+00:00', '2026-05-19T16:13:29.375+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1777545040285-k6q0a87zs9c.jpg","services/1777545051493-7kxrofg188e.jpg","services/1777545092213-u7v171yantc.jpg","services/1777545099676-dt17a99janu.jpg"]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '<p>(No&nbsp;show,&nbsp;shortening&nbsp;of&nbsp;stay,&nbsp;unexpected&nbsp;departure,&nbsp;etc.):</p><p><strong>100%&nbsp;of&