('d01bd0f7-11c6-4265-b170-496b211554af', 'Water Activities at Belle Mare Beach (From Backup: May 18)', '<p>At&nbsp;Belle&nbsp;Mare&nbsp;Beach,&nbsp;water&nbsp;activities&nbsp;like&nbsp;tube&nbsp;rides,&nbsp;parasailing,&nbsp;and&nbsp;undersea&nbsp;walking&nbsp;offer&nbsp;a&nbsp;mix&nbsp;of&nbsp;excitement&nbsp;and&nbsp;discovery,&nbsp;where&nbsp;tube&nbsp;rides&nbsp;bring&nbsp;fast,&nbsp;splashy&nbsp;thrills&nbsp;across&nbsp;the&nbsp;lagoon,&nbsp;parasailing&nbsp;provides&nbsp;stunning&nbsp;aerial&nbsp;views&nbsp;over&nbsp;the&nbsp;turquoise&nbsp;ocean,&nbsp;and&nbsp;undersea&nbsp;walks&nbsp;allow&nbsp;you&nbsp;to&nbsp;explore&nbsp;coral&nbsp;reefs&nbsp;and&nbsp;marine&nbsp;life&nbsp;up&nbsp;close&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;safe,&nbsp;guided&nbsp;experience.</p> (Imported from backup variant: JSON: TL_FULL_BACKUP_2026-05-18T08-17-19-209Z.json)', 'Belle Mare', 'East Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778919053527-qy6spely1e.jpg', '["Parasailing","Tube Rides","Undersea walk"]'::jsonb, 'activity', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:18:00.735576+00:00', '2026-05-20T04:18:00.735576+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778918789481-bno1tffrfs4.jpg","services/1778918802177-a1je8qzxt5.jpg","services/1778918819614-3yo6rye2i8w.jpg","services/1778918829536-m7qprkca6x.jpg","services/1778918857610-pe6vb4jw3gg.jpg","services/1778919022546-c628s0gidd.jpg","services/1778919033100-coso3t2mp3l.webp"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'services/1779081781800-i8gobbtrjwg.jpg', false, 0, 'services/1778918762996-6lx23b8pd8t.jpg', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'At Belle Mare Beach, tube rides, parasailing, and undersea walks offer thrilling marine adventures.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[]'::jsonb, 'Sea', 0, NULL),
('d07b9e1f-5970-423f-9fad-9c6abbf575e6', 'Ocean''s Creek Beach Hotel (Senior Citizen) (From Backup: May 19)', '<p><span style="background-color: rgb(254, 254, 254); color: rgb(103, 105, 118);">Managed&nbsp;by&nbsp;Shanti&nbsp;Hospitality,&nbsp;Ocean&#39;s&nbsp;Creek&nbsp;Beach&nbsp;Hotel&nbsp;has&nbsp;nested&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;coastal&nbsp;northwest&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;near&nbsp;Balaclava.&nbsp;With&nbsp;its&nbsp;strategic&nbsp;location,&nbsp;the&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;is&nbsp;accessible&nbsp;to&nbsp;every&nbsp;part&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;discovering&nbsp;the&nbsp;culture&nbsp;and&nbsp;nature&nbsp;experience&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;island.&nbsp;The&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;offers&nbsp;splendid&nbsp;view&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;Tombeau&nbsp;River&nbsp;and&nbsp;Le&nbsp;Goulet&nbsp;Beach,&nbsp;offering&nbsp;a&nbsp;warm&nbsp;sunset&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;end&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;day.&nbsp;With&nbsp;365&nbsp;days&nbsp;of&nbsp;versatile&nbsp;fun,&nbsp;Ocean&#39;s&nbsp;Creek&nbsp;ensures&nbsp;a&nbsp;vibrant&nbsp;guest&nbsp;experience&nbsp;with&nbsp;its&nbsp;team.</span></p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;11&nbsp;HRS</p> (Imported from backup variant: SQL: seed_2026-05-19.sql)', 'Balaclava', 'North Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778648812353-111rro0kwbg.jpg', '["FREE WIFI","RESTAURANTS & BAR","indoor & outdoor activities","gym","entertainement","kids club","Water Leisure – Pool & Jacuzzi","Waterslides","spa","Laundry service","In-house Cinema","Up to 50 parking places and coach parking"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:17:31.536099+00:00', '2026-05-20T04:17:31.536099+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778649402486-6o7k5utccwb.jpg","services/1778649422790-qicn90g6wz.jpg","services/1778649437961-iob1q1coqij.jpg","services/1778649564010-ootu8sipypl.jpg","services/1778649573835-jf6q3i3wyt.jpg","services/1778649682411-0wgau0ti00o.jpg","services/1778649693012-7r7msaide6u.jpg","servi