('d21042bf-3517-4743-a8c5-e72d2ca60f71', 'Ocean''s Creek Beach Hotel (From Backup: May 19)', '<p><span style="background-color: rgb(254, 254, 254); color: rgb(103, 105, 118);">Managed&nbsp;by&nbsp;Shanti&nbsp;Hospitality,&nbsp;Ocean&#39;s&nbsp;Creek&nbsp;Beach&nbsp;Hotel&nbsp;has&nbsp;nested&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;coastal&nbsp;northwest&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;near&nbsp;Balaclava.&nbsp;With&nbsp;its&nbsp;strategic&nbsp;location,&nbsp;the&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;is&nbsp;accessible&nbsp;to&nbsp;every&nbsp;part&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;discovering&nbsp;the&nbsp;culture&nbsp;and&nbsp;nature&nbsp;experience&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;island.&nbsp;The&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;offers&nbsp;splendid&nbsp;view&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;Tombeau&nbsp;River&nbsp;and&nbsp;Le&nbsp;Goulet&nbsp;Beach,&nbsp;offering&nbsp;a&nbsp;warm&nbsp;sunset&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;end&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;day.&nbsp;With&nbsp;365&nbsp;days&nbsp;of&nbsp;versatile&nbsp;fun,&nbsp;Ocean&#39;s&nbsp;Creek&nbsp;ensures&nbsp;a&nbsp;vibrant&nbsp;guest&nbsp;experience&nbsp;with&nbsp;its&nbsp;team.</span></p><p></p><p>Check-in&nbsp;at&nbsp;14:00</p><p>Check-out&nbsp;11:00.</p> (Imported from backup variant: SQL: seed_2026-05-19.sql)', 'Balaclava', 'Mauritius', 4.5, 'services/1777544979317-7689fp46j2w.jpg', '["Wifi ","In-house Cinema"," Laundry service","spa","gym","Up to 50 parking places and coach parking","Water Leisure - Pool & Jacuzzi","Kids Club","Indoor & Outdoor Activities"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:15:47.34875+00:00', '2026-05-20T04:15:47.34875+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1777545040285-k6q0a87zs9c.jpg","services/1777545051493-7kxrofg188e.jpg","services/1777545092213-u7v171yantc.jpg","services/1777545099676-dt17a99janu.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '<p>(No&nbsp;show,&nbsp;shortening&nbsp;of&nbsp;stay,&nbsp;unexpected&nbsp;departure,&nbsp;etc.):</p><p><strong>100%&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;total&nb