('e1657beb-2495-41d4-9e5f-90b2a0f6d8a4', 'Tarisa Resort & Spa', '<p class="ql-align-center"><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">The&nbsp;recently&nbsp;renovated&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;offers&nbsp;modern&nbsp;comfort&nbsp;and&nbsp;amenities;&nbsp;two&nbsp;restaurants,&nbsp;one&nbsp;where&nbsp;its&nbsp;guests&nbsp;can&nbsp;discover&nbsp;a&nbsp;culinary&nbsp;variety&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritian&nbsp;and&nbsp;International&nbsp;cuisines&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;other&nbsp;where&nbsp;they&nbsp;can&nbsp;enjoy&nbsp;the&nbsp;authentic&nbsp;Indian&nbsp;cuisine;&nbsp;a&nbsp;bar&nbsp;where&nbsp;its&nbsp;guests&nbsp;can&nbsp;sip&nbsp;on&nbsp;cocktails&nbsp;while&nbsp;overlooking&nbsp;the&nbsp;swimming&nbsp;pool&nbsp;and&nbsp;enjoying&nbsp;the&nbsp;sea&nbsp;view;&nbsp;relaxing&nbsp;spa&nbsp;treatments&nbsp;where&nbsp;one&nbsp;can&nbsp;unwind….</span></p><p class="ql-align-center"><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Come&nbsp;and&nbsp;relax&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;magnificent&nbsp;sandy&nbsp;beach&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mont&nbsp;Choisy.&nbsp;Its&nbsp;white&nbsp;thin&nbsp;sandy&nbsp;beach&nbsp;of&nbsp;approximately&nbsp;3&nbsp;km&nbsp;long&nbsp;will&nbsp;bring&nbsp;you&nbsp;into&nbsp;a&nbsp;realm&nbsp;of&nbsp;infinite&nbsp;dreams.</span></p><p class="ql-align-center"><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">At&nbsp;Tarisa&nbsp;Resort&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Spa,&nbsp;we&nbsp;also&nbsp;offer&nbsp;disabled-friendly&nbsp;room&nbsp;facilities.</span></p><p class="ql-align-center">Check&nbsp;in&nbsp;:&nbsp;14hrs</p><p class="ql-align-center">Check&nbsp;out&nbsp;:&nbsp;12hrs</p>', 'Mont Choisy', 'Mauritius', 4.5, 'services/1777549900199-otcr9lgn8b.jpg', '["free wifi","Free Land & Water Sports","Gym","sauna","spa","daily entertainment ","Mini club","2 swimming pools (1 kid''s pool)","jaccuzzi","restaurant & bar","babysitting services","Laundry services"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-