('eb5ba982-5e07-4869-b1a8-dec365b6e442', 'Ocean V Hotel (From Backup: May 16)', '<p>Nested&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;North&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;tropical&nbsp;island&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius&nbsp;in&nbsp;front&nbsp;of&nbsp;a&nbsp;calm&nbsp;and&nbsp;beautiful&nbsp;bay&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;north.&nbsp;Ideal&nbsp;for&nbsp;a&nbsp;fun&nbsp;and&nbsp;exciting&nbsp;stay&nbsp;for&nbsp;leisure,&nbsp;business&nbsp;travelers&nbsp;and&nbsp;for&nbsp;tourists&nbsp;exploring&nbsp;around&nbsp;the&nbsp;island.</p><p>Newly&nbsp;built,&nbsp;this&nbsp;art&nbsp;boutique&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;opened&nbsp;its&nbsp;doors&nbsp;in&nbsp;November&nbsp;2019.&nbsp;It&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;brand&nbsp;new&nbsp;property&nbsp;overlooking&nbsp;the&nbsp;beautiful&nbsp;Grand&nbsp;Baie.&nbsp;It&nbsp;consists&nbsp;of&nbsp;38&nbsp;rooms&nbsp;beautiful&nbsp;designed&nbsp;on&nbsp;two&nbsp;levels&nbsp;(1st&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;2nd&nbsp;floor).&nbsp;The&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;has&nbsp;a&nbsp;unique&nbsp;rooftop&nbsp;experience&nbsp;that&nbsp;includes&nbsp;an&nbsp;Infinity&nbsp;Pool,&nbsp;a&nbsp;Restaurant&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;Bar&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Lounge,&nbsp;the&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;also&nbsp;boasts&nbsp;a&nbsp;specialty&nbsp;Chinese&nbsp;restaurant,&nbsp;Café,&nbsp;Spa&nbsp;and&nbsp;Reception.&nbsp;It&nbsp;is&nbsp;the&nbsp;fifth&nbsp;addition&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;Sea&nbsp;Resorts&nbsp;Group&nbsp;in&nbsp;Mauritius.</p><p>This&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;is&nbsp;200m&nbsp;walking&nbsp;distance&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;famous&nbsp;Pereybere&nbsp;which&nbsp;is&nbsp;well-known&nbsp;for&nbsp;its&nbsp;fine&nbsp;sandy&nbsp;beach&nbsp;and&nbsp;best&nbsp;swim&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;north&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;island.</p><p>Adults-only&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;(as&nbsp;from&nbsp;16&nbsp;years)</p><p></p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;11&nbsp;HRS</p> (Imported from backup variant: Folder: data_2026-05-16_1918)', 'Pereybere', 'North Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778217269980-xjqn2pql1u.jpg', '["Free wifi","swimming pool","Restaur