('ebdcab2c-b6fb-480b-8a87-93cdbb5a1cb1', 'Le Jadis Beach Resort & Wellness Mauritius (From Backup: May 18)', '<p><span style="color: rgb(26, 26, 26);">Set&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;picturesque&nbsp;North&nbsp;West&nbsp;coast&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;Le&nbsp;Jadis&nbsp;Beach&nbsp;Resort&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Wellness&nbsp;-&nbsp;Managed&nbsp;by&nbsp;Banyan&nbsp;Tree&nbsp;Hotels&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Resorts,&nbsp;enjoys&nbsp;a&nbsp;prime&nbsp;location&nbsp;in&nbsp;Turtle&nbsp;Bay,&nbsp;offering&nbsp;breathtaking&nbsp;daily&nbsp;sunsets&nbsp;over&nbsp;a&nbsp;serene,&nbsp;sun-kissed&nbsp;beach.&nbsp;This&nbsp;five-star&nbsp;boutique&nbsp;resort&nbsp;features&nbsp;an&nbsp;Imperial&nbsp;Beach&nbsp;Villa&nbsp;and&nbsp;54&nbsp;spacious&nbsp;Luxury&nbsp;Suites,&nbsp;most&nbsp;with&nbsp;private&nbsp;heated&nbsp;infinity&nbsp;pools&nbsp;and&nbsp;some&nbsp;with&nbsp;additional&nbsp;standout&nbsp;features&nbsp;such&nbsp;as&nbsp;peninsular&nbsp;timber&nbsp;verandas,&nbsp;jet&nbsp;pools,&nbsp;hammams,&nbsp;and&nbsp;impressive&nbsp;handcrafted&nbsp;stone&nbsp;tubs&nbsp;with&nbsp;ocean&nbsp;view.</span></p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;11&nbsp;HRS</p> (Imported from backup variant: SQL: seed copy.sql)', 'Balaclava', 'North Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778136284491-w2twhkssfcm.jpg', '["Wifi","Restaurants","Spa & Wellness","Gym","Swimming Pool","Land Activities","Water Activities","live music evening","yoga and meditation","kids corner"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:17:17.935491+00:00', '2026-05-20T04:17:17.935491+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778136589560-f01nzdvrf8.jpg","services/1778136605711-9jvlnh9j9ai.jpg","services/1778136619534-9biwkbs20de.jpg","services/1778136646109-qcvc3x4ha9k.jpg","services/1778136662882-ioswink40v.jpg","services/1778136674792-mwuk6brgbek.jpg","services/1778136689066-cmqtgkvkbq7.jpg","services/1778136717071-ou6wlltq3a.jpg","services/1778136735776-m5ulpvzvg