('f0b84ef3-cb3d-4885-99e8-27a73682e40f', 'Paradise Cove Boutique Hotel (From Backup: May 20)', '<p>Paradise&nbsp;Cove&nbsp;Boutique&nbsp;Hotel&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;luxurious&nbsp;adults-only&nbsp;retreat&nbsp;located&nbsp;in&nbsp;Anse&nbsp;La&nbsp;Raie&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;north&nbsp;coast&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius.&nbsp;Known&nbsp;for&nbsp;its&nbsp;intimate&nbsp;atmosphere&nbsp;and&nbsp;stunning&nbsp;natural&nbsp;cove,&nbsp;the&nbsp;boutique&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;is&nbsp;especially&nbsp;popular&nbsp;with&nbsp;couples&nbsp;and&nbsp;honeymooners&nbsp;seeking&nbsp;a&nbsp;peaceful,&nbsp;romantic&nbsp;escape.&nbsp;The&nbsp;property&nbsp;features&nbsp;elegant&nbsp;rooms&nbsp;with&nbsp;tropical-inspired&nbsp;décor,&nbsp;secluded&nbsp;“love&nbsp;nests”&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;water,&nbsp;an&nbsp;infinity&nbsp;pool&nbsp;overlooking&nbsp;the&nbsp;lagoon,&nbsp;gourmet&nbsp;dining&nbsp;experiences,&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;relaxing&nbsp;spa.&nbsp;With&nbsp;its&nbsp;blend&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritian&nbsp;charm,&nbsp;personalized&nbsp;service,&nbsp;and&nbsp;breathtaking&nbsp;ocean&nbsp;views,&nbsp;Paradise&nbsp;Cove&nbsp;offers&nbsp;a&nbsp;refined&nbsp;and&nbsp;tranquil&nbsp;island&nbsp;experience.</p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;12&nbsp;HRS</p> (Imported from backup variant: SQL: seed_2026-05-15.sql)', 'Anse La Raie', 'North Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778570768649-p0j5xml3xt.jpg', '["wifi","swimming pool","Sports & Entertainment","Spa & wellness","heated pool","activities","Restaurants & bars","adult only","sea view"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:18:05.190019+00:00', '2026-05-20T04:18:05.190019+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778570855973-8rs7b6nglxn.jpg","services/1778570866096-ywphiynmw9a.jpg","services/1778570878343-01ohppw7pgew.jpg","services/1778570892351-92yhvpiatp.jpg","services/1778570903389-3xt1m0b8rzs.jpg","services/1778570922649-wlf9dweuf5.jpg","services/1778570941254-3xzmor