('f68114fa-9227-439d-a6dc-ce0c41c3847b', '5 Islands Tour by Speedboat (From Backup: May 18)', '<p>A&nbsp;5-island&nbsp;speedboat&nbsp;tour&nbsp;in&nbsp;Mauritius&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;popular&nbsp;day&nbsp;trip&nbsp;where&nbsp;you&nbsp;cruise&nbsp;across&nbsp;clear&nbsp;lagoons&nbsp;and&nbsp;visit&nbsp;several&nbsp;scenic&nbsp;islands.&nbsp;Along&nbsp;the&nbsp;way,&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;enjoy&nbsp;snorkeling&nbsp;in&nbsp;coral&nbsp;reefs,&nbsp;spotting&nbsp;marine&nbsp;life,&nbsp;and&nbsp;relaxing&nbsp;on&nbsp;white&nbsp;sandy&nbsp;beaches.&nbsp;Some&nbsp;stops&nbsp;often&nbsp;include&nbsp;Île&nbsp;aux&nbsp;Cerfs&nbsp;and&nbsp;nearby&nbsp;islets,&nbsp;with&nbsp;time&nbsp;for&nbsp;swimming,&nbsp;photos,&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;fresh&nbsp;seafood&nbsp;lunch&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;coast.</p> (Imported from backup variant: JSON: TL_FULL_BACKUP_2026-05-18T08-17-19-209Z.json)', 'Trou d''eau Douces', 'East Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778915311556-1ygukci5yhb.jpg', '["BBQ LUNCH","DRINKS","SWIMMING AT ILE AUX AIGRETTES","SNORKELING","Experienced skipper ","Free time on beaches for swimming and relaxing","Music onboard"]'::jsonb, 'activity', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:17:52.021761+00:00', '2026-05-20T04:17:52.021761+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778914828093-p22ogiab99c.jpg","services/1778914853993-65c85oyrlmv.webp","services/1778914873789-3auuuutpcwb.jpg","services/1778914898977-vasgg4eggf.jpg","services/1778914924092-k7vob1jdoid.webp","services/1778914941932-2w6mnjwzy8b.jpg","services/1778915147581-1dawdcxtx5m.jpg","services/1778915243593-abeflmr713e.png","services/1778915283649-7qv35r3oqqb.jpg","services/1778915294406-71n2yp2r7mx.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'services/1778914773217-edei8gmbxq.jpg', false, 0, 'services/1778914798220-fg144n9ehyv.jpg', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'A 5-island speedboat tour in Mauritius offers a full-day adventure acros