('0085b35e-2b6d-451b-8336-834235e9f0fa', 'Istanbul  Package (From Backup: May 20)', '<ul><li>5&nbsp;Nights’&nbsp;Stay&nbsp;at&nbsp;Four&nbsp;Lions&nbsp;Taksim&nbsp;Hotel&nbsp;(or&nbsp;Similar)</li><li>Bed&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Breakfast</li><li>Airport&nbsp;Transfers</li><li>Full-Day&nbsp;Bosphorus&nbsp;Tour</li><li>Full-Day&nbsp;Bursa&nbsp;Tour</li><li>Old&nbsp;City&nbsp;Tour</li></ul><p></p><p>Experience&nbsp;the&nbsp;vibrant&nbsp;charm&nbsp;of&nbsp;Istanbul&nbsp;with&nbsp;its&nbsp;rich&nbsp;history,&nbsp;stunning&nbsp;architecture,&nbsp;scenic&nbsp;Bosphorus&nbsp;views,&nbsp;and&nbsp;unforgettable&nbsp;cultural&nbsp;attractions.</p> (Imported from backup variant: SQL: seed_2026-05-16.sql)', 'Istanbul', NULL, 4.5, 'services/1778149649444-naqvj21jrp.jpg', '[]'::jsonb, 'packages', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:17:07.759435+00:00', '2026-05-20T04:17:07.759435+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '["Cost of package per person sharing double room"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '["Exclude Air ticket  & Visa for Istanbul"]'::jsonb, NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;Conditions&nbsp;apply,&nbsp;subject&nbsp;to&nbsp;availability</span></p>', NULL, 'services/1778149675059-ep9p3z6s23i.jpg', false, 0, 'services/1778149766499-9l4u92wfjd.jpg', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'Discover the Magic of Istanbul with Iconic Landmarks, Scenic Cruises & Timeless Cultural Experiences.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 0, 'Turkey'),
('00c827f7-f3f4-4106-b839-26d53e43a833', 'Friday Attitude (From Backup: May 18)', '<p><span style="color: rgb(78, 89, 101); background-color: rgb(228, 237, 234);">The&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;is&nbsp;located&nbsp;in&nbsp;eastern&nbsp;Mauritius&nbsp;near&nbsp;Trou&nbsp;d’Eau&nbsp;Douce,&nbsp;a&nbsp;fishing&nbsp;village&nbsp;where&nbsp;colourful&nbsp;boats&nbsp;move&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;tides.&nbsp;</span><strong style="color: rgb(78, 89, 101); background-color: rgb(228, 237, 234);">In&nbsp;short:&nbsp;peaceful.</strong></p><p><span style="color: rgb(78, 89, 101); background-color: rgb(228, 237, 234);">Just&nbsp;north&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;hotel,&nbsp;Belle&nbsp;Mare&nbsp;stretches&nbsp;out&nbsp;its&nbsp;white-sand&nbsp;carpet,&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;wilder&nbsp;Bras&nbsp;d’Eau&nbsp;forest&nbsp;invites&nbsp;shady&nbsp;walks&nbsp;under&nbsp;filao&nbsp;trees.&nbsp;Right&nbsp;across&nbsp;the&nbsp;lagoon,&nbsp;Île&nbsp;aux&nbsp;Cerfs&nbsp;–&nbsp;reachable&nbsp;by&nbsp;boat&nbsp;–&nbsp;offers&nbsp;golf&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;water&nbsp;and&nbsp;hidden&nbsp;coves.&nbsp;Then&nbsp;there’s&nbsp;Flacq,&nbsp;with&nbsp;its&nbsp;buzzing&nbsp;open-air&nbsp;market,&nbsp;fragrant&nbsp;spices,&nbsp;and&nbsp;colourful&nbsp;fruit&nbsp;stalls.&nbsp;</span><strong style="color: rgb(78, 89, 101); background-color: rgb(228, 237, 234);">A&nbsp;vibrant&nbsp;taste&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius</strong><span style="color: rgb(78, 89, 101); background-color: rgb(228, 237, 234);">.</span></p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;12&nbsp;HRS</p> (Imported from backup variant: SQL: seed copy.sql)', 'Trou d''eau Douces', 'East Coast', 4.5, 'services/1777875347127-imon16godop.jpg', '["Free wifi","swimming pool","Restaurant & bar","kids club","spa","Land activities","evening entertainment","yoga and meditation","water activities","fREE Beach towels & mineral sunscreen","Baby-sitting service","LAUNDRY SERVICES","Foreign currency exchange","PARKING","Shower and luggage rooms"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:16:54.140533+00:00', '2026-05-20T04:16:54.140533+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1777875524887-3j54xyzmkh9.webp","services/1777875540500-1eamnrud6c5.jpg","services/1777875557502-zszryp1xcnd.jpg","services/1777875568661-z72xqeowll.jpg","services/1777875577437-r2wwwm6ezvk.jpg","services/1777875588071-hjmjmevly8.png","services/1777875607593-agqfkdqdgd.jpg","services/1777875618274-utom0dm70w.jpg","services/1777875636577-7r3mw70ddm8.jpg","services/1777875646199-hjaykksr48.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>Cancellation&nbsp;Policy</p><p>The&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;cancellation&nbsp;policy&nbsp;shall&nbsp;be&nbsp;as&nbsp;follows&nbsp;:</p><p>Cancellation&nbsp;date/period&nbsp;</p><p>Rate&nbsp;payable</p><p>Between&nbsp;D-7&nbsp;and&nbsp;D-4&nbsp;:&nbsp;50%&nbsp;of&nbsp;total&nbsp;rate&nbsp;payable</p><p>Between&nbsp;D-3&nbsp;and&nbsp;D-1:&nbsp;&nbsp;80%&nbsp;of&nbsp;total&nbsp;rate&nbsp;payable</p><p>Peak&nbsp;season&nbsp;between&nbsp;D-30&nbsp;and&nbsp;D-1:&nbsp;100%&nbsp;of&nbsp;total&nbsp;rate&nbsp;payable</p><p>No&nbsp;shows:&nbsp;100%&nbsp;of&nbsp;total&nbsp;rate&nbsp;payable</p><p>Unexpected&nbsp;departure:&nbsp;No&nbsp;refund.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p></p>', '<p>Rates&nbsp;are&nbsp;in&nbsp;MUR&nbsp;per&nbsp;room&nbsp;per&nbsp;night&nbsp;on&nbsp;&#39;Half&nbsp;Board&#39;&nbsp;basis&nbsp;[&nbsp;Breakfast&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Dinner&nbsp;].</p><p></p><p>Children&nbsp;who&nbsp;are&nbsp;less&nbsp;than&nbsp;3&nbsp;years&nbsp;old&nbsp;are&nbsp;FOC&nbsp;on&nbsp;parents&nbsp;meal&nbsp;plan&nbsp;booked.</p><p></p><p>A&nbsp;minimum&nbsp;of&nbsp;2&nbsp;children/teens&nbsp;is&nbsp;required&nbsp;per&nbsp;room&nbsp;for&nbsp;children/teens&nbsp;in&nbsp;their&nbsp;own&nbsp;room.</p><p></p><p>Single&nbsp;Parent&nbsp;Policy&nbsp;:&nbsp;1&nbsp;Adult&nbsp;+&nbsp;1&nbsp;Teen&nbsp;=&nbsp;Pays&nbsp;2&nbsp;*&nbsp;1/2&nbsp;Double.</p><p></p><p>Minimum&nbsp;of&nbsp;2-nights&nbsp;stay&nbsp;for&nbsp;All&nbsp;inclusive&nbsp;basis&nbsp;and&nbsp;Half&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Full&nbsp;board&nbsp;basis&nbsp;for&nbsp;1&nbsp;night&nbsp;stay</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 'services/1777875373855-81v2qffrc1h.jpg', false, 0, 'services/1777875389421-e2a34ouhhkm.jpg', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'Some holidays are for running around, planning, seeing every possible sight. Then there are holidays at Friday Attitude in Mauritius. Here, there’s no fuss, just freedom and an easy life. The vibe is set.
