('99dcd6af-67f6-4c45-91f7-f900b98ee46e', 'Ocean V Hotel (From Backup: May 18)', '<p>Nested&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;North&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;tropical&nbsp;island&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius&nbsp;in&nbsp;front&nbsp;of&nbsp;a&nbsp;calm&nbsp;and&nbsp;beautiful&nbsp;bay&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;north.&nbsp;Ideal&nbsp;for&nbsp;a&nbsp;fun&nbsp;and&nbsp;exciting&nbsp;stay&nbsp;for&nbsp;leisure,&nbsp;business&nbsp;travelers&nbsp;and&nbsp;for&nbsp;tourists&nbsp;exploring&nbsp;around&nbsp;the&nbsp;island.</p><p>Newly&nbsp;built,&nbsp;this&nbsp;art&nbsp;boutique&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;opened&nbsp;its&nbsp;doors&nbsp;in&nbsp;November&nbsp;2019.&nbsp;It&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;brand&nbsp;new&nbsp;property&nbsp;overlooking&nbsp;the&nbsp;beautiful&nbsp;Grand&nbsp;Baie.&nbsp;It&nbsp;consists&nbsp;of&nbsp;38&nbsp;rooms&nbsp;beautiful&nbsp;designed&nbsp;on&nbsp;two&nbsp;levels&nbsp;(1st&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;2nd&nbsp;floor).&nbsp;The&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;has&nbsp;a&nbsp;unique&nbsp;rooftop&nbsp;experience&nbsp;that&nbsp;includes&nbsp;an&nbsp;Infinity&nbsp;Pool,&nbsp;a&nbsp;Restaurant&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;Bar&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Lounge,&nbsp;the&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;also&nbsp;boasts&nbsp;a&nbsp;specialty&nbsp;Chinese&nbsp;restaurant,&nbsp;Café,&nbsp;Spa&nbsp;and&nbsp;Reception.&nbsp;It&nbsp;is&nbsp;the&nbsp;fifth&nbsp;addition&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;Sea&nbsp;Resorts&nbsp;Group&nbsp;in&nbsp;Mauritius.</p><p>This&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;is&nbsp;200m&nbsp;walking&nbsp;distance&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;famous&nbsp;Pereybere&nbsp;which&nbsp;is&nbsp;well-known&nbsp;for&nbsp;its&nbsp;fine&nbsp;sandy&nbsp;beach&nbsp;and&nbsp;best&nbsp;swim&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;north&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;island.</p><p>Adults-only&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;(as&nbsp;from&nbsp;16&nbsp;years)</p><p></p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;11&nbsp;HRS</p> (Imported from backup variant: JSON: TL_FULL_BACKUP_2026-05-18T08-17-19-209Z.json)', 'Pereybere', 'North Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778217269980-xjqn2pql1u.jpg', '["Free wifi","swimming pool","Restaurant & Bar","GYM","spa"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:17:28.643356+00:00', '2026-05-20T04:17:28.643356+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778217899628-4y387ofea6u.jpg","services/1778217910200-tchlcch1els.jpg","services/1778217920137-71pb52dkgxt.jpg","services/1778217934819-k5crb2cull.webp","services/1778217951016-898s49ih6de.webp","services/1778217959143-z3biv7acux.webp","services/1778217979896-9mv547vd91h.webp","services/1778217991780-fmqy1u0dgm9.jpg","services/1778218005160-u16vaszuqt.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '<p></p>', NULL, 'services/1778502853946-ir1j13943qc.jpg', false, 0, 'services/1778217338047-ogvbu4u1kuk.webp', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'Ocean V Hotel is a modern adults-only hotel near the beach in Grand Baie, Mauritius, with ocean views and a rooftop pool.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[{"id":"1778220715511","label":"Bed & Breakfast"},{"id":"1778220778823","label":"Half Board"},{"id":"1778220786686","label":"All Inclusive"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 0, NULL),
