('9d330063-ae11-4a4b-98b6-31e011d54e5d', 'Tarisa Resort & Spa (From Backup: May 18)', '<p class="ql-align-center"><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">The&nbsp;recently&nbsp;renovated&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;offers&nbsp;modern&nbsp;comfort&nbsp;and&nbsp;amenities;&nbsp;two&nbsp;restaurants,&nbsp;one&nbsp;where&nbsp;its&nbsp;guests&nbsp;can&nbsp;discover&nbsp;a&nbsp;culinary&nbsp;variety&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritian&nbsp;and&nbsp;International&nbsp;cuisines&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;other&nbsp;where&nbsp;they&nbsp;can&nbsp;enjoy&nbsp;the&nbsp;authentic&nbsp;Indian&nbsp;cuisine;&nbsp;a&nbsp;bar&nbsp;where&nbsp;its&nbsp;guests&nbsp;can&nbsp;sip&nbsp;on&nbsp;cocktails&nbsp;while&nbsp;overlooking&nbsp;the&nbsp;swimming&nbsp;pool&nbsp;and&nbsp;enjoying&nbsp;the&nbsp;sea&nbsp;view;&nbsp;relaxing&nbsp;spa&nbsp;treatments&nbsp;where&nbsp;one&nbsp;can&nbsp;unwind….</span></p><p class="ql-align-center"><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Come&nbsp;and&nbsp;relax&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;magnificent&nbsp;sandy&nbsp;beach&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mont&nbsp;Choisy.&nbsp;Its&nbsp;white&nbsp;thin&nbsp;sandy&nbsp;beach&nbsp;of&nbsp;approximately&nbsp;3&nbsp;km&nbsp;long&nbsp;will&nbsp;bring&nbsp;you&nbsp;into&nbsp;a&nbsp;realm&nbsp;of&nbsp;infinite&nbsp;dreams.</span></p><p class="ql-align-center"><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">At&nbsp;Tarisa&nbsp;Resort&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Spa,&nbsp;we&nbsp;also&nbsp;offer&nbsp;disabled-friendly&nbsp;room&nbsp;facilities.</span></p><p class="ql-align-center">Check&nbsp;in&nbsp;:&nbsp;14hrs</p><p class="ql-align-center">Check&nbsp;out&nbsp;:&nbsp;12hrs</p> (Imported from backup variant: JSON: TL_FULL_BACKUP_2026-05-18T08-17-19-209Z.json)', 'Mont Choisy', 'Mauritius', 4.5, 'services/1777549900199-otcr9lgn8b.jpg', '["free wifi","Free Land & Water Sports","Gym","sauna","spa","daily entertainment ","Mini club","2 swimming pools (1 kid''s pool)","jaccuzzi","restaurant & bar","babysitting services","Laundry services"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:16:07.870745+00:00', '2026-05-20T04:16:07.870745+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1777549695809-rcv16oxbz7r.jpg","services/1777549717432-qbu20ij8d2.jpg","services/1777549733008-qjjgvse2c7.jpg","services/1777549741891-ulezavzrlw.jpg","services/1777549750902-ea875n7ep5l.jpg","services/1777549759420-1o3xyo7n3tc.jpg","services/1777549787570-m537x615a3b.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'services/1777549912809-7w3932t2dcu.jpg', false, 0, 'services/1777549665008-25yqhwbls5j.jpg', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'Situated at a prime seaside location, the hotel gives direct access to one of the most popular sandy beaches of the island, where one can admire the magnificent warm turquoise lagoon, experience a selection of water sports activities whilst being in close proximity to local attractions', NULL, NULL, 12, '[{"id":"1778080139815","label":"Full Board"},{"id":"1778080147777","label":"All Inclusive"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 0, NULL),
('9d86212b-1552-41ce-8032-7ee8fd6707fe', 'Ocean''s Creek Beach Hotel', '<p><span style="background-color: rgb(254, 254, 254); color: rgb(103, 105, 118);">Managed&nbsp;by&nbsp;Shanti&nbsp;Hospitality,&nbsp;Ocean&#39;s&nbsp;Creek&nbsp;Beach&nbsp;Hotel&nbsp;has&nbsp;nested&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;coastal&nbsp;northwest&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;near&nbsp;Balaclava.&nbsp;With&nbsp;its&nbsp;strategic&nbsp;location,&nbsp;the&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;is&nbsp;accessible&nbsp;to&nbsp;every&nbsp;part&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;discovering&nbsp;the&nbsp;culture&nbsp;and&nbsp;nature&nbsp;experience&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;island.&nbsp;The&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;offers&nbsp;splendid&nbsp;view&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;Tombeau&nbsp;River&nbsp;and&nbsp;Le&nbsp;Goulet&nbsp;Beach,&nbsp;offering&nbsp;a&nbsp;warm&nbsp;sunset&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;end&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;day.&nbsp;With&nbsp;365&nbsp;days&nbsp;of&nbsp;versatile&nbsp;fun,&nbsp;Ocean&#39;s&nbsp;Creek&nbsp;ensures&nbsp;a&nbsp;vibrant&nbsp;guest&nbsp;experience&nbsp;with&nbsp;its&nbsp;team.</span></p><p></p><p>Check-in&nbsp;at&nbsp;14:00</p><p>Check-out&nbsp;11:00.</p>', 'Balaclava', 'Mauritius', 4.5, 'services/1777544979317-7689fp46j2w.jpg', '["Wifi ","In-house Cinema"," Laundry service","spa","gym","Up to 50 parking places and coach parking","Water Leisure - Pool & Jacuzzi","Kids Club","Indoor & Outdoor Activities"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30T10:39:15.773+00:00', '2026-04-30T10:41:50.077+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1777545040285-k6q0a87zs9c.jpg","services/1777545051493-7kxrofg188e.jpg","services/1777545092213-u7v171yantc.jpg","services/1777545099676-dt17a99janu.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '<p>(No&nbsp;show,&nbsp;shortening&nbsp;of&nbsp;stay,&nbsp;unexpected&nbsp;departure,&nbsp;etc.):</p><p><strong>100%&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;total&nbsp;booking&nbsp;value/charges</strong>&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;applicable,&nbsp;as&nbsp;from&nbsp;confirmation&nbsp;date.</p>', '<ul><li><ul><li>The&nbsp;above&nbsp;rates&nbsp;are&nbsp;quoted&nbsp;in&nbsp;<strong>MUR</strong>,&nbsp;on&nbsp;<strong>All-Inclusive&nbsp;basis</strong>,&nbsp;and&nbsp;inclusive&nbsp;of&nbsp;all&nbsp;charges.</li><li>Applicable&nbsp;only&nbsp;to&nbsp;<u>new&nbsp;bookings</u>.&nbsp;</li><li>Note&nbsp;that&nbsp;the&nbsp;rooms&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;subject&nbsp;to&nbsp;availability&nbsp;upon&nbsp;booking&nbsp;time.</li><li>Check-in&nbsp;at&nbsp;14:00&nbsp;and&nbsp;Check-out&nbsp;11:00.</li><li>Other&nbsp;T&amp;Cs&nbsp;apply.</li></ul></li></ul>', NULL, 'services/1777545007002-cqaqx5iavxl.jpg', false, 0, 'services/1777545016824-dn4hf3bn41.jpg', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'Managed by Shanti Hospitality, Ocean''s Creek Beach Hotel has nested on the coastal northwest of Mauritius, near Balaclava.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[{"id":"1778141488777","label":"All inclusive"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 0, NULL),
('9e28a57e-c460-48f4-aaa4-56c80bebd930', 'Orchid Villas by Sea Resorts Hotels (From Backup: May 19)', '<p>Orchid&nbsp;Villas,&nbsp;located&nbsp;along&nbsp;the&nbsp;Coastal&nbsp;Road&nbsp;of&nbsp;Belle&nbsp;Mare,&nbsp;is&nbsp;an&nbsp;exclusive&nbsp;collection&nbsp;of&nbsp;six&nbsp;private&nbsp;pool&nbsp;villas,&nbsp;each&nbsp;featuring&nbsp;three&nbsp;bedrooms,&nbsp;designed&nbsp;to&nbsp;offer&nbsp;privacy,&nbsp;comfort,&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;refined&nbsp;island&nbsp;living&nbsp;experience.&nbsp;Ideal&nbsp;for&nbsp;families,&nbsp;the&nbsp;villas&nbsp;combine&nbsp;contemporary&nbsp;amenities&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;relaxed,&nbsp;upscale&nbsp;atmosphere,&nbsp;in&nbsp;line&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;boutique&nbsp;standards&nbsp;of&nbsp;Sea&nbsp;Resorts.</p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;TIME&nbsp;:&nbsp;15.00</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;TIME&nbsp;:&nbsp;10.00</p> (Imported from backup variant: SQL: seed_2026-05-19.sql)', 'Belle Mare', 'East Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778832765520-3bjkfjohlto.jpg', '["fREE WIFI","Private outdoor swimming pool","Restaurant & bar","free parking"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:17:37.139797+00:00', '2026-05-20T04:17:37.139797+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778832886446-fai42k5dhm9.jpg","services/1778832930592-x4mi8a00fmp.jpg","services/1778832945071-rxl9o15212.jpg","services/1778832959932-xox6c9779b.jpg","services/1778832976318-cb9t5pi9gyo.jpg","services/1778833012442-rh2kyzf55bj.jpg","services/1778833025658-n18xob4o54n.jpg","services/1778833113274-vtwkltnnczk.jpg","services/1778833127350-io6rwt8g38h.jpg"]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '<p>Cancellations&nbsp;of&nbsp;14&nbsp;days&nbsp;or&nbsp;less&nbsp;prior&nbsp;to&nbsp;arrival&nbsp;or&nbsp;No&nbsp;shows&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;charged&nbsp;50%&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;total&nbsp;reservation&nbsp;amount&nbsp;Cancellations&nbsp;of&nbsp;07&nbsp;days&nbsp;or&nbsp;less&nbsp;prior&nbsp;to&nbsp;arrival&nbsp;or&nbsp;No&nbsp;shows&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;charged&nbsp;100%&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;total&nbsp;reservation&nbsp;amount&nbsp;Unexpected&nbsp;departure&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;charged&nbsp;100%&nbsp;of&nbsp;remaining&nbsp;stay&nbsp;as&nbsp;per&nbsp;original&nbsp;booking&nbsp;No-shows&nbsp;will&nbsp;bear&nbsp;a&nbsp;penalty&nbsp;fee&nbsp;of&nbsp;100%&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;total&nbsp;booking&nbsp;amount</p>', NULL, NULL, 'services/1778832773902-hfayolqoqh.jpg', false, 0, 'services/1778832804468-405dy8pglzm.jpg', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'Orchid Villas by Sea Resorts offers private pool villas near Belle Mare beach, blending comfort, privacy, tropical gardens, and modern amenities.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[{"id":"1778833851284","label":"Bed & Breakfast"},{"id":"1778833862412","label":"Half-board"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 0, NULL),
('9ea48636-c518-4925-83c9-903d83ca797d', 'Pattaya & Bangkok Group Tour (From Backup: May 18)', '<ul><li>Air&nbsp;Ticket&nbsp;With&nbsp;Air&nbsp;Austral&nbsp;</li><li>2&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;Stay&nbsp;In&nbsp;Pattaya&nbsp;At&nbsp;Baron&nbsp;Beach&nbsp;Pattaya,&nbsp;3*&nbsp;(Or&nbsp;Similar)</li><li>Full&nbsp;Day&nbsp;Coral&nbsp;Island&nbsp;With&nbsp;Lunch</li><li>5&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;Stay&nbsp;In&nbsp;Bangkok&nbsp;At&nbsp;Century&nbsp;Park&nbsp;Hotel,&nbsp;4*&nbsp;(Or&nbsp;Similar)</li><li>Daily&nbsp;Breakfast</li><li>Return&nbsp;Airport&nbsp;Transfer</li><li>Chao&nbsp;Praya&nbsp;Dinner&nbsp;Cruise</li><li>Floating&nbsp;Market</li><li>Half&nbsp;Day&nbsp;Bangkok&nbsp;City&nbsp;Tour&nbsp;</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p></p><pre data-language="plain">
