('f7b11619-200e-406b-bebc-d281e506daf9', 'Marguery Villas (From Backup: May 19)', '<p>Nestled&nbsp;between&nbsp;lagoon&nbsp;and&nbsp;mountains,&nbsp;our&nbsp;villas&nbsp;for&nbsp;rent&nbsp;in&nbsp;Mauritius&nbsp;within&nbsp;the&nbsp;Marguery&nbsp;Villas&nbsp;Resort&nbsp;offers&nbsp;an&nbsp;independent&nbsp;tropical&nbsp;haven&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;private&nbsp;pool&nbsp;and&nbsp;attentive&nbsp;concierge&nbsp;service.</p><p>The&nbsp;perfect&nbsp;balance&nbsp;of&nbsp;freedom,&nbsp;comfort,&nbsp;and&nbsp;immersion&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;gentle&nbsp;rhythm&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;within&nbsp;an&nbsp;officially&nbsp;licensed&nbsp;tourism&nbsp;residence.</p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS&nbsp;</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;11&nbsp;HRS</p><p></p> (Imported from backup variant: SQL: seed_2026-05-19.sql)', 'Black River', 'West Coast', 4.5, 'services/1778576670518-r60fc58lcn.jpg', '["WIFI","SWIMMING POOL","FITNESS ROOM","Outdoor dining area","International cuisine","Mauritian cuisine","Halal food","Musical ambiance","Unlimited filtered water","Dining and room service","Children''s Corner","SPA"]'::jsonb, 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-20T04:18:10.275137+00:00', '2026-05-20T04:18:10.275137+00:00', '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '', '', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'services/1778576691499-do60t0znj1e.jpg', false, 0, 'services/1778576718507-5tpw1p2wpte.jpg', false, 'Limited Time', true, false, 'Marguery Villas provides upscale private villas, tropical gardens, pools, spa access, and personalized concierge hospitality.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[{"id":"1778576793427","label":"Bed & Breakfast"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 0, NULL),
